WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:37.257
What my dad said has come true.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.460
Yazhini, do you know
your dad's story?

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.933
I mean, RSK's history.

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:07.993
What story?

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:13.913
In the first five years
after founding RSK,

00:02:14.286 --> 00:02:15.406
your dad struggled a lot.

00:02:15.967 --> 00:02:17.593
He didn't land
a single major case.

00:02:17.973 --> 00:02:20.606
Twice, he came close to having
to shut down the firm.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:23.882
He may have forgotten those
days over the past thirty years,

00:02:23.906 --> 00:02:24.926
but I haven't.

00:02:26.126 --> 00:02:27.366
If that's what he went through,

00:02:27.966 --> 00:02:29.393
we've only just begun.

00:02:29.993 --> 00:02:31.580
There's still
so much more to face.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:41.227
Doesn't losing hurt you at all?

00:02:41.653 --> 00:02:42.653
It hurts a lot.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.400
But I don't believe
this is the end.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.160
They've taken the case away
from us, haven't they?

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.780
But there's still a way to get
this case back into our hands.

00:02:55.146 --> 00:02:56.015
What is it?

00:02:56.039 --> 00:02:58.359
Where did the Rs. 300 crore go
from the Wellstone Trust?

00:02:58.673 --> 00:03:00.320
If we find the answer to that,

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.686
we'll be back on track.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:09.920
Fine.

00:03:11.006 --> 00:03:12.360
I'll see what I can do.

00:03:12.573 --> 00:03:14.980
Okay. Not today.
Go home and get some rest.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:16.940
We can start afresh tomorrow.

00:03:20.662 --> 00:03:21.662
Can I tell you something?

00:03:22.515 --> 00:03:24.155
You won't take it the wrong way,
will you?

00:03:27.282 --> 00:03:28.282
If you wish,

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.442
would you hire a junior..

00:03:30.995 --> 00:03:33.456
with good communication
and advocacy skills?

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.287
Listen, Yazhini.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.040
It was because of
the Sheeba case you brought in

00:03:44.064 --> 00:03:45.737
that our firm became profitable.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.927
And when I fainted,
you handled the Maari case.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.934
You were the one who uncovered
a massive scam at the bank.

00:03:54.254 --> 00:03:56.534
You didn't do all of this
merely thinking of it as a job.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.580
And I know that.

00:03:57.767 --> 00:03:59.774
Those eloquent juniors
you're talking about

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:02.787
aren't as talented as you are.
I know that.

00:04:03.794 --> 00:04:04.794
And..

00:04:05.147 --> 00:04:06.607
Why are you bringing
all this up now?

00:04:06.787 --> 00:04:08.487
Even though I personally
asked you not to,

00:04:08.734 --> 00:04:10.867
you took on the surrogacy case,
fought it, and won.

00:04:11.147 --> 00:04:12.627
Where has that Yazhini
disappeared to?

00:04:13.827 --> 00:04:15.467
Instead of dwelling
on unnecessary things,

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:17.120
think about
what we should do next.

00:04:17.707 --> 00:04:19.867
Even if no one else believes
in you, it doesn't matter.

00:04:20.214 --> 00:04:21.574
I believe in you
with all my heart.

00:04:31.274 --> 00:04:32.274
Thank you.

00:04:50.264 --> 00:04:51.890
Hello, Senior.
Where are you two?

00:04:52.297 --> 00:04:53.573
We're on our way.
We'll be there soon.

00:04:53.597 --> 00:04:55.237
How much longer
should I wait for you two?

00:04:55.544 --> 00:04:56.704
Go ahead. We'll be there
in five minutes.

00:04:56.728 --> 00:04:58.408
All right, I'm heading over.
You come too.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:00.710
Viswa.

00:05:01.157 --> 00:05:03.037
I want to ask you something.
Will you answer me?

00:05:06.157 --> 00:05:07.157
What is it?

00:05:07.697 --> 00:05:08.733
Why are you
looking at me like that?

00:05:08.757 --> 00:05:10.584
Why haven't you told me
about your family?

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.250
What do you want me to say?

00:05:15.123 --> 00:05:17.417
That my dad and grandfather
were both court attendants?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.610
Do you know how
everyone at court treated me?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.237
My dad knows
everyone at the court.

00:05:29.044 --> 00:05:31.270
Renowned judges
and senior barristers,

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.770
all of them.

00:05:33.624 --> 00:05:35.573
After finishing my studies,
I approached them for work.

00:05:35.597 --> 00:05:36.997
Every single one of them
would ask..

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.310
"Aren't you
the court attendant's son?"

00:05:40.684 --> 00:05:41.764
That's what they would ask.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.570
Yet not one of them
gave me a chance.

00:05:46.717 --> 00:05:47.997
I struggled
for three whole years

00:05:48.984 --> 00:05:50.070
to get where I am today.

00:05:51.077 --> 00:05:52.317
Do you know how many odd jobs

00:05:52.341 --> 00:05:54.020
I had to do just to get
this one opportunity?

00:05:54.044 --> 00:05:55.044
You already know.

00:05:55.384 --> 00:05:58.737
I even offered notary services
from a small van outside..

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.950
My dad can no longer
stand for long periods.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:03.410
I need to let him rest.

00:06:03.982 --> 00:06:05.680
I need to take proper care of
everyone who depends on me.

00:06:05.704 --> 00:06:06.704
That's all.

00:06:07.464 --> 00:06:08.464
Only now

00:06:09.077 --> 00:06:11.624
do I feel like my life
is finally beginning anew.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.130
Muthu,

00:06:15.897 --> 00:06:17.857
why did you give me the money

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:20.690
you worked so hard to save?
- It's just money, isn't it?

00:06:21.877 --> 00:06:22.917
I can always earn it back.

00:06:24.497 --> 00:06:25.497
Why, Muthu?

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:28.210
You say your whole family
depends on you.

00:06:28.804 --> 00:06:30.717
Yet you insist on giving
that money to me?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.650
No matter how much I explain,
you just don't understand.

00:06:36.664 --> 00:06:37.744
Shall I tell you the truth?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.124
I couldn't bear to see you
in that state.

00:06:42.204 --> 00:06:43.204
Truly unbearable.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:44.930
You were facing..

00:06:45.236 --> 00:06:46.343
it all alone.

00:06:47.424 --> 00:06:49.864
He scolds you whenever he feels
like it and simply walks away.

00:06:50.657 --> 00:06:51.657
I felt..

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.630
I should have been
by your side then.

00:06:55.364 --> 00:06:56.364
I really did.

00:06:56.684 --> 00:06:57.684
Why, Muthu?

00:06:58.884 --> 00:06:59.884
Why do you care so much?

00:07:00.844 --> 00:07:02.164
Why are you so concerned
about me?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.330
What? Don't you want me to care?

00:07:10.744 --> 00:07:11.924
I didn't say that.

00:07:27.115 --> 00:07:28.115
Then?

00:07:28.329 --> 00:07:29.329
Well?

00:07:33.535 --> 00:07:34.815
We're running late. Shall we go?

00:07:35.415 --> 00:07:36.855
What about the answer
to my question?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.887
Because I love you so much,
Keerthana.

00:07:49.913 --> 00:07:50.913
Is that enough?

00:07:58.002 --> 00:07:59.242
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:08:00.407 --> 00:08:01.527
Because I already knew.

00:08:15.156 --> 00:08:16.156
I love you, dear.

00:08:21.711 --> 00:08:22.711
I love you too, Muthu.

00:08:36.889 --> 00:08:38.369
Will the food be here soon?
- It will.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:41.750
'What kind of Sambar is this?
It doesn't even smell good.'

00:08:44.316 --> 00:08:46.623
Sister, what's for lunch today?

00:08:48.501 --> 00:08:50.501
Dosa.
- Dosa?

00:08:50.841 --> 00:08:53.107
All right, here's what you do.
Take some peanuts,

00:08:53.201 --> 00:08:55.741
roast them lightly
and put them in a mixer.

00:08:55.841 --> 00:08:57.734
Add a few green chillies
and shallots,

00:08:57.759 --> 00:08:59.714
a little garlic
and a bit of tamarind.

00:08:59.739 --> 00:09:01.454
Grind everything
into a coarse paste.

00:09:01.567 --> 00:09:03.861
Heat a little coconut oil
and add mustard seeds.

00:09:03.886 --> 00:09:07.067
Add plenty of curry leaves,
mix well and bring it over.

00:09:07.334 --> 00:09:08.781
It'll be delicious!
- Hey,

00:09:09.201 --> 00:09:11.727
why not just ask
for peanut chutney?

00:09:12.247 --> 00:09:13.607
Look at the way
you're carrying on!

00:09:13.721 --> 00:09:14.863
Here's what you do.

00:09:14.963 --> 00:09:16.942
Come inside and grind it yourself.

00:09:17.074 --> 00:09:19.154
And slice the green chillies
while you're at it.

00:09:19.178 --> 00:09:21.340
What? Me? No way!
I can't do all that.

00:09:21.454 --> 00:09:22.527
In that case,

00:09:23.641 --> 00:09:25.834
keep quiet and eat
the coconut chutney.

00:09:25.858 --> 00:09:27.587
You want me to shut up?
Fine. Love you!

00:09:27.612 --> 00:09:28.825
Look at his audacity!

00:09:30.103 --> 00:09:31.123
'Look at her.'
- Viswa..

00:09:31.277 --> 00:09:32.754
What is it, Sathyan?
- Would you like anything else?

00:09:32.778 --> 00:09:34.792
No, Sathyan. Nothing else.

00:09:35.836 --> 00:09:36.990
The dosa is ready.
- Ma'am.

00:09:37.988 --> 00:09:40.087
Here's your favourite
coconut chutney.

00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:41.333
Go ahead and eat.

00:09:44.272 --> 00:09:45.272
Just a moment.

00:09:48.716 --> 00:09:49.716
That's enough.

00:09:51.936 --> 00:09:52.936
Aren't you going to eat?

00:09:53.939 --> 00:09:54.939
Here, have a bite.

00:09:56.116 --> 00:09:57.389
Hey, here.

00:10:03.434 --> 00:10:04.434
Eat up!

00:10:07.994 --> 00:10:08.994
Muthu.

00:10:12.073 --> 00:10:13.647
'Why is she behaving
so strangely?'

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.426
What? Is it spicy?

00:10:16.318 --> 00:10:18.151
Spicy? Is it that spicy?

00:10:18.432 --> 00:10:19.432
No, Sathyan.

00:10:22.234 --> 00:10:23.234
Muthu?

00:10:25.924 --> 00:10:26.924
What is it?
- Muthu.

00:10:27.366 --> 00:10:28.366
Which brand is it?

00:10:29.291 --> 00:10:30.291
Brand?

00:10:30.399 --> 00:10:32.084
No, I meant which brand
of lipstick you're wearing.

00:10:32.108 --> 00:10:33.738
Since when have you started
applying lipstick to your cheek?

00:10:33.762 --> 00:10:35.442
'Oh no!'

00:10:39.694 --> 00:10:40.907
To the right! To the right!

00:10:41.282 --> 00:10:43.862
'Oh! To the right!'
- There! Right there!

00:10:44.416 --> 00:10:45.443
'Caught red-handed!'

00:10:47.925 --> 00:10:49.005
You wretched lot!

00:10:49.227 --> 00:10:51.041
Is this why you left me
stranded halfway?

00:10:51.767 --> 00:10:52.767
Shut up!

00:10:52.831 --> 00:10:53.632
You're telling me to shut up

00:10:53.656 --> 00:10:54.421
when you can't keep
your own mouth shut?

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:55.998
You're something else, Senior!

00:10:56.185 --> 00:10:57.290
Hey, get lost.
- 'A kiss, huh?'

00:10:57.314 --> 00:10:59.528
'How was it, Senior?'
- 'No.' - Muthu!

00:11:20.432 --> 00:11:21.432
Eat up.

00:11:32.883 --> 00:11:33.883
Muthu.

00:11:33.953 --> 00:11:34.953
Ma'am?

00:11:36.632 --> 00:11:38.572
Your dad spoke to me
on the phone.

00:11:38.899 --> 00:11:39.912
He was quite upset.

00:11:40.425 --> 00:11:42.339
At least from now on, I hope
you'll control your temper

00:11:42.363 --> 00:11:44.539
and behave responsibly.
- Sure, ma'am.

00:11:47.465 --> 00:11:48.705
You're in love now,

00:11:49.392 --> 00:11:51.312
and patience is very important
in a relationship.

00:11:52.992 --> 00:11:53.992
Sorry, ma'am.

00:11:54.572 --> 00:11:56.592
Does anyone apologise
for falling in love?

00:11:57.752 --> 00:11:58.752
Sorry.

00:11:59.539 --> 00:12:00.825
Take good care of Keerthana.

00:12:03.559 --> 00:12:05.065
All right, ma'am.
- Bye. - Bye, ma'am.

00:12:06.772 --> 00:12:07.772
Goodbye, ma'am.

00:12:12.604 --> 00:12:15.383
Done advising your juniors,
I see?

00:12:20.216 --> 00:12:21.363
But looking at them

00:12:21.909 --> 00:12:23.309
reminds me
so much of the two of us.

00:12:25.743 --> 00:12:27.789
I hope they at least
stay happy together.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.176
Why are you spoiling
the mood, Veni?

00:12:31.476 --> 00:12:34.116
I only wished for them
to be happy together.

00:12:34.696 --> 00:12:35.696
All right.
- Hey!

00:12:36.716 --> 00:12:38.463
Come here for a moment.
- What for?

00:12:38.703 --> 00:12:40.036
There's a pile of dishes
over there.

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.980
They all need to be washed
and put away. Come on.

00:12:42.196 --> 00:12:43.196
Dishes?

00:12:43.981 --> 00:12:45.851
What's this, Veni?
- She's calling you, isn't she?

00:12:45.875 --> 00:12:48.161
Go and help her. - She's
asking me to wash dishes?

00:12:48.555 --> 00:12:49.775
Go on, wash them.

00:12:50.841 --> 00:12:52.161
Are you two
conspiring against me?

00:12:55.735 --> 00:12:57.015
That old woman!

00:13:18.225 --> 00:13:20.039
Hey, Yazhini! Come on in.

00:13:20.659 --> 00:13:22.785
Muthu, Keerthana
and the others just left.

00:13:23.212 --> 00:13:24.212
Come, sit down.

00:13:33.799 --> 00:13:34.799
What is it, Yazhini?

00:13:35.121 --> 00:13:36.761
Are you still upset
about losing the case?

00:13:39.082 --> 00:13:40.082
Yes.

00:13:40.865 --> 00:13:41.865
I'm afraid..

00:13:42.352 --> 00:13:44.879
my dad's prediction
might come true.

00:13:47.604 --> 00:13:49.557
Yazhini, what is it
you really want?

00:13:51.884 --> 00:13:53.524
I want to become
a successful lawyer.

00:13:53.864 --> 00:13:56.264
Then focus on that.

00:13:56.764 --> 00:13:59.517
Don't get so caught up
in proving your dad wrong.

00:14:01.918 --> 00:14:03.911
How can you say that?
Aren't they the same thing?

00:14:04.595 --> 00:14:06.935
No. There's a huge difference.

00:14:07.536 --> 00:14:08.876
In a lawyer's career,

00:14:09.456 --> 00:14:11.542
both success
and failure are inevitable.

00:14:11.829 --> 00:14:13.749
Enjoy your work and do it
because you love it.

00:14:13.849 --> 00:14:16.616
You don't have to prove
anything to anyone.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:22.770
Do you understand?

00:14:26.442 --> 00:14:28.096
Hey! Careful! Easy!

00:14:28.121 --> 00:14:30.243
You old woman!
- What's all that noise?

00:14:30.596 --> 00:14:32.523
It's complete chaos inside.
Come on.

00:14:33.379 --> 00:14:35.413
Hey! No, not there!

00:14:35.553 --> 00:14:38.579
Not there, put it here!
Do you even know how to work?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.240
Is this a library?

00:14:42.327 --> 00:14:43.887
Do you have to stack them
in a neat row?

00:14:43.991 --> 00:14:46.211
Have you no shame?

00:14:46.635 --> 00:14:48.828
You're making the guests work
while you sit around.

00:14:48.853 --> 00:14:50.166
Have you no shame?

00:14:50.262 --> 00:14:51.502
And you even get paid for this!

00:14:51.879 --> 00:14:54.813
Hey, I don't even work for Veni!
- What, Veni..

00:14:54.913 --> 00:14:56.610
Why should I work
for all of you?

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.686
You come here to dance and sing,

00:14:58.759 --> 00:15:01.292
while I'm expected to cook
and clean up after you?

00:15:01.539 --> 00:15:02.939
As if you ever
cook proper meals!

00:15:03.026 --> 00:15:04.452
Does this kitchen look like it?

00:15:04.572 --> 00:15:07.352
You just keep ordering food
online and stuffing yourselves!

00:15:07.432 --> 00:15:08.839
You're wasting all her money!

00:15:10.166 --> 00:15:11.766
You'd better hand
your salary over to me!

00:15:12.166 --> 00:15:14.079
What? My salary?

00:15:14.486 --> 00:15:16.539
Whenever you come here,

00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:18.919
Veni feeds you for free!

00:15:19.006 --> 00:15:21.126
Isn't that enough? And now
you dare ask for my salary?

00:15:21.812 --> 00:15:23.295
Get out of here!
Go mind your own work!

00:15:23.319 --> 00:15:24.479
Feeding me for free, you say?

00:15:24.698 --> 00:15:25.924
Is that why I'm running around

00:15:25.948 --> 00:15:27.388
like a monkey,
doing all the chores..

00:15:28.409 --> 00:15:30.882
'Oh no!'
- Good grief!

00:15:31.251 --> 00:15:32.176
Yazhini.

00:15:32.276 --> 00:15:33.441
What on earth is going on,
Sathyan?

00:15:33.579 --> 00:15:34.845
I was giving the old woman

00:15:34.945 --> 00:15:35.992
a lecture on domestic..
- Hey!

00:15:37.866 --> 00:15:40.086
The young lady is being tutored
on domestic violence.

00:15:43.508 --> 00:15:45.028
Look at how she is teasing.

00:15:46.375 --> 00:15:47.668
'Both of them won't stop.'

00:15:55.102 --> 00:15:56.102
'Where is it?'

00:16:04.238 --> 00:16:05.238
'It's not there.'

00:16:20.776 --> 00:16:21.776
'Anjali Varma..'

00:16:22.937 --> 00:16:24.217
'I've seen her
somewhere before.'

00:16:43.064 --> 00:16:44.064
'Now I understand

00:16:44.329 --> 00:16:45.989
where the 300 crore rupees went.'

00:16:57.342 --> 00:16:58.408
Hi.
- Hey.

00:16:58.722 --> 00:16:59.895
Here.
- What's this?

00:17:00.342 --> 00:17:02.941
I made this Biryani. Taste it
and tell me what you think.

00:17:07.464 --> 00:17:08.464
Go on, eat.

00:17:15.604 --> 00:17:16.924
Did you really
make this yourself?

00:17:17.847 --> 00:17:18.847
I'll slap you!

00:17:20.538 --> 00:17:21.744
Anyway, forget all that.

00:17:22.624 --> 00:17:24.004
Come on a date with me,
won't you?

00:17:27.518 --> 00:17:28.518
Kavin,

00:17:29.224 --> 00:17:30.411
let's just stay good friends.

00:17:31.084 --> 00:17:33.191
Why do you keep putting me
in the friend zone?

00:17:33.637 --> 00:17:34.951
I'm only asking you out
on one date.

00:17:34.975 --> 00:17:36.135
We could go out and have fun.

00:17:36.271 --> 00:17:37.271
Have fun, you say?

00:17:37.838 --> 00:17:39.447
Let me explain it
in a way you'll understand.

00:17:39.471 --> 00:17:41.344
When two people
date and then break up,

00:17:41.392 --> 00:17:42.512
they often become strangers.

00:17:42.871 --> 00:17:44.084
They might not stay in touch.

00:17:44.438 --> 00:17:46.064
Unnecessary complications,
Kavin.

00:17:47.164 --> 00:17:49.124
And losing you
wouldn't be easy for me.

00:17:49.984 --> 00:17:52.191
So, let's not complicate things
by dating casually.

00:17:52.764 --> 00:17:55.691
You're one of the few
good friends I have.

00:17:56.624 --> 00:17:57.624
So..

00:17:59.404 --> 00:18:00.764
let's keep things
the way they are.

00:18:01.184 --> 00:18:02.664
You always know
how to spoil the mood!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.230
Hello?

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.746
This is T. Nagar Police Station.

00:18:10.846 --> 00:18:11.950
Your friend Viswa is here.

00:18:12.303 --> 00:18:14.550
What happened?
- Could you come to the station?

00:18:14.708 --> 00:18:15.708
I'll be there right away.

00:18:15.839 --> 00:18:17.206
Hey, what happened?

00:18:17.663 --> 00:18:18.793
Come with me. Quickly.

00:18:18.893 --> 00:18:20.141
Where?
- Come on!

00:18:20.528 --> 00:18:21.528
Hurry!

00:18:23.496 --> 00:18:26.549
If you'd given us this case
when I first suggested it,

00:18:26.722 --> 00:18:28.352
none of this would
have happened, would it?

00:18:28.376 --> 00:18:30.776
You're absolutely right, sir.
We made a mistake.

00:18:30.982 --> 00:18:33.756
It would be a great relief
if you took over this case.

00:18:34.622 --> 00:18:36.276
All right. I'll look into it.

00:18:36.609 --> 00:18:38.124
Things will turn around
at the next hearing.

00:18:38.224 --> 00:18:39.304
Thank you, sir.

00:18:39.809 --> 00:18:41.049
One more thing.
- Yes, sir?

00:18:41.094 --> 00:18:43.100
I need every file
related to this case.

00:18:43.389 --> 00:18:44.389
Don't leave anything out.

00:18:44.502 --> 00:18:46.456
Sure, sir.
You will get whatever you need.

00:18:46.481 --> 00:18:47.742
All right.
- Thank you, sir.

00:18:54.042 --> 00:18:55.042
Shailu,

00:18:55.742 --> 00:18:57.136
you take over this case.

00:18:58.009 --> 00:18:59.803
Dad, if you don't mind,

00:19:00.842 --> 00:19:02.222
this is Yazhini's case.

00:19:03.789 --> 00:19:06.202
The bank gave both Yazhini
and Deva a chance.

00:19:07.083 --> 00:19:09.609
They lost. Now it's our case.

00:19:10.096 --> 00:19:11.176
Besides,

00:19:11.929 --> 00:19:15.109
who else has a 100% win rate
against Karunakaran?

00:19:20.328 --> 00:19:22.561
All right, dad. I'll handle it.
- Good.

00:19:42.348 --> 00:19:44.262
Why have you given my chamber
to someone else?

00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:51.217
You still have
your own chamber, don't you?

00:19:51.241 --> 00:19:53.121
Not that one. I mean
the chamber assigned to me.

00:19:55.031 --> 00:19:55.987
Deva,

00:19:56.011 --> 00:19:58.538
many lawyers are waiting
for a chamber of their own.

00:19:59.008 --> 00:20:01.328
We can only accommodate them
where there's space, can't we?

00:20:01.602 --> 00:20:02.648
That's hardly my concern.

00:20:02.782 --> 00:20:04.762
It's your responsibility
to create more space.

00:20:04.862 --> 00:20:06.295
Why should I give up my chamber?

00:20:06.782 --> 00:20:08.629
That wasn't our agreement.
- Deva,

00:20:08.962 --> 00:20:10.562
you'll always have a chamber
of your own.

00:20:11.055 --> 00:20:13.669
You won't have to sit
under a tree again.

00:20:15.275 --> 00:20:16.689
That was our agreement,
wasn't it?

00:20:17.789 --> 00:20:18.789
That's not all.

00:20:19.362 --> 00:20:21.042
When you didn't have
a chamber of your own,

00:20:21.269 --> 00:20:23.569
weren't you the one
who came to my chamber

00:20:23.869 --> 00:20:25.269
and said you were
fine with sharing?

00:20:26.349 --> 00:20:28.249
What you did then,
I am doing now.

00:20:30.669 --> 00:20:32.922
The request for new chambers
will be approved soon.

00:20:33.889 --> 00:20:35.922
So, this arrangement will
only last a few more days.

00:20:51.283 --> 00:20:54.036
'Sir, please let me go!
I'm a lawyer too!'

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.750
'Yes, you're here!'
- What's it? - What's it?

00:20:57.037 --> 00:20:58.723
'What can I say?'

00:21:04.683 --> 00:21:07.203
What happened, sir? Why have
you made him sit over there?

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:09.903
This fellow was loitering
around here suspiciously.

00:21:10.143 --> 00:21:11.553
When we questioned him,
he claimed to be a lawyer.

00:21:11.577 --> 00:21:13.430
Yes, sir. He really is a lawyer.

00:21:18.243 --> 00:21:20.083
We received information
that illegal activities

00:21:20.137 --> 00:21:21.973
were taking place
at a massage parlour in Egmore.

00:21:21.997 --> 00:21:24.037
When we checked,
we found him there.

00:21:24.177 --> 00:21:26.383
We got suspicious and
brought him in for questioning.

00:21:26.464 --> 00:21:27.464
Good grief!
- Good grief!

00:21:27.777 --> 00:21:29.319
When questioned,
he claimed to be a lawyer.

00:21:29.343 --> 00:21:30.996
Please don't take this
the wrong way,

00:21:31.183 --> 00:21:32.743
but what was he doing there?

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:35.343
'What was he doing, indeed!'

00:21:46.306 --> 00:21:47.613
Even we don't know that.

00:21:48.852 --> 00:21:50.026
'I didn't do anything, mate.'

00:21:50.972 --> 00:21:53.279
So, you didn't catch him
doing anything wrong, did you?

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:00.634
No, ma'am.

00:22:00.734 --> 00:22:02.220
Then release him
immediately, sir.

00:22:02.384 --> 00:22:03.984
I'll get his statement
and submit it.

00:22:04.156 --> 00:22:05.396
Since you claim to be a lawyer,

00:22:05.777 --> 00:22:07.917
provide your details
and take him with you.

00:22:08.057 --> 00:22:09.057
Thank you, sir.

00:22:09.671 --> 00:22:10.984
Send him!

00:22:13.614 --> 00:22:14.614
Greetings, sir.

00:22:26.051 --> 00:22:28.057
Why are you laughing?

00:22:30.163 --> 00:22:31.297
Tell me the truth.

00:22:31.637 --> 00:22:32.881
You went there to have
some fun, didn't you?

00:22:33.385 --> 00:22:35.430
Yes. I went to have some fun!
Want to join me?

00:22:36.264 --> 00:22:37.824
'Don't take your
frustration out on me!'

00:22:39.012 --> 00:22:40.492
Why on earth did you go there?

00:22:40.985 --> 00:22:41.985
Tell me!

00:22:42.945 --> 00:22:44.945
Promise you won't tell anyone.

00:22:45.478 --> 00:22:47.198
Just tell me already!
- Just speak up first!

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.393
Next week,
my family is taking me

00:22:49.493 --> 00:22:50.868
to meet a prospective bride.

00:22:51.493 --> 00:22:53.860
'Look at what I'll do to you..'
- Hey, no, no.

00:22:53.953 --> 00:22:54.953
Okay.
- Be quiet.

00:22:55.111 --> 00:22:56.111
Sorry. Go on, tell us!

00:22:57.718 --> 00:23:00.145
It's nothing much.
A girl I know said

00:23:00.525 --> 00:23:02.165
she was selling
a fairness cream.

00:23:02.778 --> 00:23:04.265
So, I transferred Rs. 2,000 to her.

00:23:05.011 --> 00:23:06.574
After that,
she stopped answering my calls.

00:23:06.598 --> 00:23:08.765
After I called her thirty times,
she finally answered

00:23:08.871 --> 00:23:10.752
and asked me to come
to the massage parlour.

00:23:11.065 --> 00:23:12.432
And then?
- What else?

00:23:13.709 --> 00:23:14.754
So, I went there.

00:23:14.854 --> 00:23:16.438
I lost my Rs. 2,000
and never got the cream!

00:23:16.602 --> 00:23:18.522
And now I've lost my dignity
in front of you too!

00:23:18.814 --> 00:23:21.707
Hey, go..
- Hey! Come on, mate!

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:26.013
Besides, you have
a handsome dusky complexion.

00:23:26.457 --> 00:23:27.777
Why do you want to become fair?

00:23:28.076 --> 00:23:29.976
Exactly, mate!
Dusky is our natural complexion.

00:23:30.029 --> 00:23:31.389
What's wrong
with the way you look?

00:23:31.623 --> 00:23:33.323
Easy for you to say!

00:23:33.476 --> 00:23:35.034
You're on all kinds
of dating apps!

00:23:35.134 --> 00:23:37.512
Chatting with girls and roaming
around town is what you do! I..

00:23:37.536 --> 00:23:38.856
Why are you
bringing this up here?

00:23:38.909 --> 00:23:40.669
Oh, is that the matter?
- Don't you know it?

00:23:44.092 --> 00:23:45.092
Viswa,

00:23:45.794 --> 00:23:48.600
you don't need to
change yourself for anyone.

00:23:49.118 --> 00:23:50.118
Just be yourself.

00:23:50.978 --> 00:23:52.258
The right person
will come along.

00:23:52.417 --> 00:23:53.671
'For me?'

00:23:54.064 --> 00:23:56.437
When will she come along?
When will I meet her?

00:23:57.512 --> 00:23:59.825
And when will we buy
a flat of our own?

00:23:59.985 --> 00:24:02.319
Listen, my dear ones

00:24:02.558 --> 00:24:04.805
don't tell anyone
at court about this!

00:24:06.252 --> 00:24:07.339
Come on, mate!

00:24:07.364 --> 00:24:09.343
You won't tell anyone,
will you, my dear friends?

00:24:21.729 --> 00:24:22.729
What happened, Deva?

00:24:23.138 --> 00:24:24.258
Why do you look so troubled?

00:24:25.570 --> 00:24:27.370
Ms Veni has finally
shown her true colours.

00:24:27.468 --> 00:24:28.468
Why?

00:24:28.563 --> 00:24:29.176
What happened?

00:24:29.200 --> 00:24:31.220
She assigned our chamber
to another junior lawyer.

00:24:31.883 --> 00:24:33.309
Permanently?
- No.

00:24:34.433 --> 00:24:36.033
Until the new block
of chambers is ready.

00:24:37.162 --> 00:24:38.522
It's only for a few days,
isn't it?

00:24:38.812 --> 00:24:39.812
We can manage.

00:24:40.057 --> 00:24:41.057
Anyway, leave that aside.

00:24:41.425 --> 00:24:42.792
We'll get our case back.

00:24:43.101 --> 00:24:44.101
How?

00:24:45.833 --> 00:24:47.806
Karan Real Estate's
latest township project,

00:24:48.387 --> 00:24:50.533
is worth Rs. 300 crore.
So, what about it?

00:24:51.126 --> 00:24:53.673
Two years ago, the company
was drowning in debt and losses.

00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:55.720
But that's not
the important part right now.

00:24:57.186 --> 00:24:58.186
Just a moment.

00:25:01.580 --> 00:25:03.973
Look at this.
This is Anjali Varma,

00:25:04.733 --> 00:25:06.253
the chairperson
of the Wellstone Trust.

00:25:10.372 --> 00:25:13.112
Now I understand where the money
from the Wellstone Trust went.

00:25:14.752 --> 00:25:15.752
Exactly.

00:25:16.672 --> 00:25:18.512
I don't think this is
just a coincidence, Deva.

00:25:18.716 --> 00:25:20.583
We can find out by checking
whether the Wellstone Trust

00:25:20.607 --> 00:25:22.327
bought any land
over the past year.

00:25:22.554 --> 00:25:25.041
Well done, Yazhini.
If we inform the MD immediately,

00:25:25.262 --> 00:25:26.742
we might be able
to get the case back.

00:25:30.454 --> 00:25:32.188
The MD is calling.
- Find out what it is.

00:25:36.120 --> 00:25:37.167
Hello, sir.
- Deva,

00:25:37.240 --> 00:25:39.167
'RSK will be handling this case
from now on.'

00:25:39.434 --> 00:25:42.047
'Hand over all the files
related to this case to them.'

00:25:43.414 --> 00:25:46.421
Sir, we've found a lead.
We're very close to solving it.

00:25:46.504 --> 00:25:48.744
Deva, just do as I say.
- But, sir..

00:26:00.819 --> 00:26:01.819
Deva,

00:26:03.257 --> 00:26:04.697
has the case been
handed over to RSK?

00:26:11.757 --> 00:26:13.997
They've asked us to hand over
the case files immediately.

00:26:32.911 --> 00:26:33.911
Yazhini,

00:26:34.138 --> 00:26:35.138
are you all right?

00:26:38.476 --> 00:26:39.476
Come on.

00:26:49.617 --> 00:26:51.538
Sir, may I come in?
- Come in.

00:27:15.258 --> 00:27:17.771
Sir, this may not seem
like a major case to you,

00:27:18.127 --> 00:27:19.367
yet for us, it is not so.

00:27:19.933 --> 00:27:21.293
This case could define
our careers.

00:27:21.827 --> 00:27:23.107
And we're so close
to winning it.

00:27:23.440 --> 00:27:25.107
Please give us just
one more hearing to continue.

00:27:25.131 --> 00:27:26.371
So close, yet so far away.

00:27:27.413 --> 00:27:29.773
Unfortunately, you've already
lost this case.

00:27:30.880 --> 00:27:32.120
If you'd argued
the case properly,

00:27:32.144 --> 00:27:33.297
this wouldn't have happened.

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:36.407
The case now belongs
to RSK Associates.

00:27:39.870 --> 00:27:40.870
Dad..

00:27:43.750 --> 00:27:45.350
If you hadn't interfered,

00:27:46.008 --> 00:27:47.288
none of this would
have happened.

00:27:47.886 --> 00:27:49.866
We only lost one hearing,

00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:52.480
not the entire case.

00:27:53.919 --> 00:27:54.919
Shailu,

00:27:55.101 --> 00:27:58.181
that hit-and-run case
involving the gangster..

00:27:58.319 --> 00:27:59.519
What was his name?

00:28:01.683 --> 00:28:02.683
Maari.

00:28:03.722 --> 00:28:04.722
Maari.

00:28:05.392 --> 00:28:07.919
Didn't you take the Maari case
away from Veni in the same way?

00:28:08.751 --> 00:28:09.917
What, Mr Deva?

00:28:09.941 --> 00:28:11.981
One rule for yourself
and another for everyone else?

00:28:12.253 --> 00:28:14.566
Deva didn't go behind
anyone's back like you did!

00:28:15.809 --> 00:28:17.889
Watch your words and
remember who you're speaking to!

00:28:18.203 --> 00:28:20.483
Just because I let it pass,
you speak whatever you please?

00:28:20.543 --> 00:28:22.203
Dad, please.
- Stay out of this!

00:28:22.989 --> 00:28:24.900
Karunakaran ripped you apart
in court

00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:26.635
at the very first hearing!

00:28:26.735 --> 00:28:27.900
You had no words to offer then!

00:28:27.958 --> 00:28:29.931
The bank came to us only because

00:28:29.955 --> 00:28:31.702
you left them
with no other option.

00:28:31.971 --> 00:28:34.351
For now,
you've only lost this one case.

00:28:34.758 --> 00:28:36.565
One call to the MD from me,

00:28:36.590 --> 00:28:38.465
and the bank will terminate
your retainer.

00:28:38.975 --> 00:28:39.975
Do you want to test me?

00:28:40.573 --> 00:28:41.573
Mr Raj Sekar..

00:28:43.973 --> 00:28:44.973
What?

00:28:45.498 --> 00:28:46.498
Are you threatening us?

00:28:48.144 --> 00:28:49.144
Guys,

00:28:49.681 --> 00:28:51.288
can we please keep
this professional?

00:29:01.643 --> 00:29:02.643
Deva..

00:29:03.410 --> 00:29:05.437
We need the case files.

00:29:06.284 --> 00:29:08.537
The next hearing is approaching.

00:29:08.689 --> 00:29:10.072
Sir, you'll have
all the files you requested

00:29:10.096 --> 00:29:11.469
on your desk by this evening.

00:29:11.864 --> 00:29:13.324
Yazhini, come on. Let's go.

00:29:35.967 --> 00:29:36.967
'Hello, Deva.'

00:29:37.075 --> 00:29:39.575
'I urgently need Rs. 3 lakhs.'

00:29:39.958 --> 00:29:42.491
'Arrange the money for me
immediately, no matter what.'

00:31:44.466 --> 00:31:45.466
Deva.

00:31:48.386 --> 00:31:49.386
Why did you come here?

00:31:50.120 --> 00:31:51.933
I need to talk to you.
Come outside.

00:31:56.673 --> 00:31:58.646
Deva, who is that man?

00:32:00.793 --> 00:32:02.509
Hand over the files
at the RSK office.

00:32:02.609 --> 00:32:03.844
I'll be right back.

00:32:15.441 --> 00:32:17.117
How many times have I
told you not to come here?

00:32:17.141 --> 00:32:18.601
Hey, this is a court.

00:32:18.988 --> 00:32:20.481
It's not your father's property.

00:32:20.628 --> 00:32:22.048
Anyone can come here.

00:32:29.713 --> 00:32:30.833
Take your hand off me, Deva.

00:32:31.100 --> 00:32:32.107
Everyone is watching.

00:32:32.253 --> 00:32:33.973
If I say anything,

00:32:34.127 --> 00:32:36.480
you'll be the one getting
into trouble. Think about it.

00:32:37.247 --> 00:32:38.820
Fine. What do you want now?

00:32:39.013 --> 00:32:40.653
You took money from me
just two weeks ago!

00:32:40.920 --> 00:32:43.840
I've spent it all, man!
You know what I'm like.

00:32:44.680 --> 00:32:46.587
On top of that, I'm in debt.

00:32:47.627 --> 00:32:50.953
So, arrange Rs. 3 lakhs
within two days

00:32:51.060 --> 00:32:52.355
and let me know.
I'll come and collect it.

00:32:52.379 --> 00:32:55.320
Rs. 3 lakhs? Are you kidding me?
- Not at all.

00:32:55.627 --> 00:32:57.180
I'm absolutely serious.

00:32:58.067 --> 00:33:00.187
Don't you joke around.
It'll be better for you.

00:33:02.093 --> 00:33:03.240
You've got just two days.

00:33:04.333 --> 00:33:05.973
Otherwise,
I'll go straight to the school.

00:33:06.393 --> 00:33:07.767
I'll see to it. Get going.

00:33:08.860 --> 00:33:10.900
Have the money ready
in two days. That's a good boy.

00:33:36.783 --> 00:33:37.783
'Love..'

00:33:38.939 --> 00:33:40.346
'I should tell Ms Veni

00:33:40.371 --> 00:33:42.832
and get these two
married off right away.'

00:33:43.421 --> 00:33:45.028
'Look at them.'

00:33:53.557 --> 00:33:54.924
What's your problem?

00:33:55.658 --> 00:33:57.931
Hey, you're always
hanging around the canteen!

00:33:58.088 --> 00:33:59.088
Go and do your work!

00:33:59.222 --> 00:34:00.830
So, you knew I was here
all along, didn't you?

00:34:00.930 --> 00:34:01.934
No.
- No.

00:34:02.024 --> 00:34:03.515
Was it deliberate?
- Yes..

00:34:03.805 --> 00:34:05.985
That's just like her.

00:34:06.585 --> 00:34:08.339
Oh my, why are you
sighing so much?

00:34:08.862 --> 00:34:10.803
All right, come on.
We have a lot of work to do.

00:34:10.828 --> 00:34:13.254
Wait, what work? I need him!

00:34:13.449 --> 00:34:15.089
Hey, I need Viswa!

00:34:15.412 --> 00:34:17.612
Hey, Ms Veni asked us
to review the committee files.

00:34:17.726 --> 00:34:19.519
Did she tell you?
Didn't she ask you to come?

00:34:19.543 --> 00:34:21.543
She told me the same thing!
I need Viswa.

00:34:21.655 --> 00:34:22.993
Stop fooling around and come on.
- Hey,

00:34:23.017 --> 00:34:24.277
stop fooling around, Keerthana!

00:34:25.496 --> 00:34:26.945
Why are you behaving like this?
- Like what?

00:34:27.045 --> 00:34:28.123
Just like this!

00:34:28.314 --> 00:34:31.348
'You're always bickering!'
- 'Between them..'

00:34:34.795 --> 00:34:37.042
Senior, we have two junior
lawyers with us, don't we?

00:34:37.301 --> 00:34:38.427
Why are you two arguing?

00:34:40.201 --> 00:34:41.481
'You're behaving like children!'

00:34:41.824 --> 00:34:43.171
Oh, that's right!
- Isn't that so?

00:34:43.195 --> 00:34:44.275
'What else?'

00:34:44.554 --> 00:34:47.534
Seniors, something
hilarious happened this morning!

00:34:47.641 --> 00:34:48.919
Guess what!
- Something hilarious?

00:34:49.140 --> 00:34:51.052
Senior, you mentioned reviewing
the committee files, didn't you?

00:34:51.076 --> 00:34:52.805
Come on, let's go.
- Hey, sit down!

00:34:53.041 --> 00:34:54.794
Why are you so nervous?
- Yes, right.

00:34:55.788 --> 00:34:57.021
The police caught..

00:34:57.535 --> 00:34:58.872
our Viswa and took him away!

00:34:58.972 --> 00:35:00.160
The police?
- The police?

00:35:01.354 --> 00:35:02.808
Hey, what have you done now?

00:35:03.374 --> 00:35:04.694
Nothing, Senior!
- It's nothing.

00:35:04.822 --> 00:35:06.155
Our Viswa..

00:35:06.729 --> 00:35:08.542
went to one of those
massage parlours.

00:35:09.942 --> 00:35:11.302
The police raided the place,

00:35:12.406 --> 00:35:13.406
and he was caught there!

00:35:14.281 --> 00:35:16.294
You sinner!
- I'm not, Senior!

00:35:16.318 --> 00:35:18.387
You look so innocent
on the outside,

00:35:18.600 --> 00:35:19.880
but look what you've been up to!

00:35:20.007 --> 00:35:21.280
What, Viswa?

00:35:22.005 --> 00:35:23.412
Were you having fun?
- Senior,

00:35:23.705 --> 00:35:25.692
a girl I know works there.

00:35:26.039 --> 00:35:26.805
My family is arranging

00:35:26.829 --> 00:35:28.195
a bride-seeing ceremony
for me next week.

00:35:28.219 --> 00:35:30.045
I just wanted to lighten
my skin a little,

00:35:30.105 --> 00:35:31.845
so I ordered a tub
of cream from her.

00:35:32.139 --> 00:35:33.419
I only went there to collect it,

00:35:33.745 --> 00:35:35.372
but the police caught me!
- Hey, Viswa.

00:35:35.679 --> 00:35:37.148
What you're saying
doesn't sound believable at all!

00:35:37.172 --> 00:35:38.645
It's the truth, Senior!

00:35:40.479 --> 00:35:41.679
Right, right! Very believable!

00:35:42.779 --> 00:35:44.645
Senior,
don't look at me like that!

00:35:45.352 --> 00:35:46.472
I'm not that kind of person!

00:35:46.645 --> 00:35:48.479
We know, man! Now keep quiet!
- Senior..

00:35:51.538 --> 00:35:53.002
Didn't I tell you
to keep it to yourself?

00:35:53.026 --> 00:35:54.753
I was just joking, man!
- Just joking!

00:35:58.726 --> 00:36:00.300
Don't worry, Mr Vinay.

00:36:01.478 --> 00:36:02.478
Just relax.

00:36:04.454 --> 00:36:06.654
How can I not worry?

00:36:07.844 --> 00:36:10.224
A case handled
by two unknown advocates

00:36:10.248 --> 00:36:11.974
is now in the hands
of RSK Associates!

00:36:14.456 --> 00:36:17.256
Sir, there are only
two days left until the hearing.

00:36:17.810 --> 00:36:20.596
They don't have
any concrete evidence.

00:36:21.209 --> 00:36:22.903
The case was only
just handed over to them,

00:36:23.270 --> 00:36:26.896
so they won't have enough time
to gather any information.

00:36:27.143 --> 00:36:28.143
Forget RSK.

00:36:28.756 --> 00:36:30.803
Even God himself
couldn't do anything now.

00:36:32.216 --> 00:36:35.017
I think you're being too
confident, Karunakaran.

00:36:35.110 --> 00:36:37.310
They've already traced the money
to the Wellstone Trust.

00:36:37.596 --> 00:36:39.932
How long do you think it'll take
RSK to investigate further?

00:36:39.956 --> 00:36:40.945
You know what will happen

00:36:41.025 --> 00:36:41.958
if this comes to light, don't you?

00:36:42.058 --> 00:36:42.921
Sir, I'm not being
overconfident.

00:36:43.436 --> 00:36:45.036
I'm saying this
with complete confidence.

00:36:45.396 --> 00:36:47.850
They have no reason
to suspect you.

00:36:48.377 --> 00:36:51.064
In fact, you're not even
on their radar.

00:36:51.216 --> 00:36:52.216
So, take it easy.

00:36:52.483 --> 00:36:54.190
What if they use Anjali
to get to me?

00:36:56.504 --> 00:36:57.504
Sir..

00:36:59.397 --> 00:37:00.504
There are several people..

00:37:00.797 --> 00:37:03.037
in this trust whose wives
are involved, just like Anjali.

00:37:04.063 --> 00:37:06.516
Do you think they can suspect
everyone? That's not practical.

00:37:07.716 --> 00:37:09.130
So, we're certain
to win this case.

00:37:10.856 --> 00:37:11.883
Listen, Karunakaran,

00:37:12.523 --> 00:37:14.217
do you know how many cases

00:37:14.241 --> 00:37:15.974
you've won against
RSK Associates?

00:37:16.454 --> 00:37:19.034
Zero. A big fat zero!

00:37:20.561 --> 00:37:22.455
That's exactly why I have
every reason to worry.

00:37:22.880 --> 00:37:24.507
Make sure you handle
the case properly.

00:37:45.534 --> 00:37:46.534
Shailu..

00:37:47.292 --> 00:37:48.792
Hey, Yazhu!

00:37:49.119 --> 00:37:50.119
Careful!

00:37:50.943 --> 00:37:52.196
Put it on the table.

00:37:59.673 --> 00:38:02.173
All the files you need
are in here. Go through them.

00:38:05.400 --> 00:38:06.400
Yazhu..

00:38:07.665 --> 00:38:08.665
I'm sorry, dear.

00:38:09.604 --> 00:38:12.425
I know how hard
you worked on this case.

00:38:15.262 --> 00:38:16.262
Shailu..

00:38:16.842 --> 00:38:18.009
Why are you apologising?

00:38:18.377 --> 00:38:19.637
None of this is your fault.

00:38:20.330 --> 00:38:21.530
We came so close.

00:38:22.023 --> 00:38:24.070
I'm just disappointed
that we couldn't do anything.

00:38:24.976 --> 00:38:26.336
How could you possibly
be at fault?

00:38:26.950 --> 00:38:28.970
So, you're not angry with me?

00:38:31.016 --> 00:38:32.016
Not at all.

00:38:32.396 --> 00:38:34.116
There's something else
I forgot to tell you.

00:38:35.243 --> 00:38:37.150
I know you brought dad

00:38:37.843 --> 00:38:38.856
to the hearing that day.

00:38:40.803 --> 00:38:41.936
That was really sweet.

00:38:42.248 --> 00:38:43.248
Thank you.

00:38:45.528 --> 00:38:46.717
When he saw you arguing the case,

00:38:46.797 --> 00:38:48.086
I thought he'd understand,

00:38:48.219 --> 00:38:49.344
but..
- But..

00:38:49.636 --> 00:38:51.349
All he could see were my flaws,
wasn't it?

00:38:51.910 --> 00:38:52.910
Yazhu...

00:38:54.003 --> 00:38:55.216
Shailaja..

00:38:55.650 --> 00:38:56.730
You know something?

00:38:58.033 --> 00:38:59.033
While I was arguing

00:38:59.560 --> 00:39:00.413
the case that day,

00:39:00.437 --> 00:39:02.157
I kept looking into
dad's eyes now and then.

00:39:03.603 --> 00:39:05.590
All I could see was
his fear that I might lose,

00:39:05.856 --> 00:39:07.883
embarrass him
and damage his reputation.

00:39:10.696 --> 00:39:11.710
He didn't show even

00:39:11.734 --> 00:39:13.494
the slightest desire
for his daughter to win.

00:39:13.890 --> 00:39:15.050
But I have that faith in you.

00:39:16.010 --> 00:39:18.110
It's not just hope. It's faith.

00:39:19.403 --> 00:39:20.890
I believe you'll win.

00:39:22.697 --> 00:39:23.697
Just a moment.

00:39:32.020 --> 00:39:33.020
I know.

00:39:34.947 --> 00:39:36.340
Your faith is my strength.

00:39:37.580 --> 00:39:38.820
This is what gives me strength.

00:39:39.727 --> 00:39:40.727
Thank you.

00:39:43.113 --> 00:39:44.113
All right.

00:39:44.273 --> 00:39:46.626
All the information
is in these files, isn't it?

00:39:47.126 --> 00:39:48.346
See?

00:39:49.039 --> 00:39:50.673
Do you think RSK's lawyers
are ordinary?

00:39:51.326 --> 00:39:52.726
Look at you showing off!

00:39:53.350 --> 00:39:54.957
Stop teasing me!
- All right.

00:39:55.479 --> 00:39:57.688
Everything you need
is in these files.

00:39:57.713 --> 00:39:59.613
Go through everything,
all right? And..

00:40:00.133 --> 00:40:01.647
All the best.
- Thank you.

00:40:01.747 --> 00:40:02.798
You do well.

00:40:03.599 --> 00:40:05.233
I'll take my leave.
- See you.

00:40:11.020 --> 00:40:12.240
Shailu..
- Yes?

00:40:14.635 --> 00:40:15.635
Love you.

00:40:17.461 --> 00:40:18.461
Love you too.

00:40:19.482 --> 00:40:20.582
Okay. All the best.

00:40:26.142 --> 00:40:27.149
Sudalai, pass it.

00:40:35.494 --> 00:40:36.494
Hey..

00:40:36.756 --> 00:40:37.756
Hey!

00:40:38.631 --> 00:40:40.431
Why are you sitting there
looking so dejected?

00:40:40.969 --> 00:40:41.652
Nothing.

00:40:41.676 --> 00:40:43.809
Amreen has friend-zoned him!

00:40:44.844 --> 00:40:45.844
Friend zone?

00:40:46.005 --> 00:40:47.699
What kind of zone is that?
I've never heard of it!

00:40:47.723 --> 00:40:49.917
You've been serving cookies
for 15 years, haven't you?

00:40:49.970 --> 00:40:52.146
Similarly, your son will keep
serving green tea until the end.

00:40:52.170 --> 00:40:54.490
Sudalai, who asked you?
- I'm staying out of this.

00:40:55.857 --> 00:40:57.217
Why are you
getting angry with her?

00:40:57.470 --> 00:40:59.577
She was honest
and straightforward with you.

00:41:00.150 --> 00:41:01.950
There's nothing wrong
with being friends, man.

00:41:01.977 --> 00:41:03.646
Respect her decision
if that's what she wants.

00:41:03.670 --> 00:41:04.705
Why wouldn't you say that?

00:41:04.729 --> 00:41:06.289
Your love life
is going perfectly well.

00:41:06.450 --> 00:41:07.656
That's why you're acting
so smug.

00:41:07.756 --> 00:41:08.864
Kavin, I..

00:41:12.755 --> 00:41:14.608
Why is he so jealous of me?
- Exactly.

00:41:15.001 --> 00:41:16.999
You just keep admiring
from a distance, and you..

00:41:17.099 --> 00:41:18.183
Hey!

00:41:18.813 --> 00:41:21.293
Looks like both of you will be
admiring them from afar forever.

00:41:25.623 --> 00:41:27.803
Good heavens! Is it her? No!

00:41:29.360 --> 00:41:30.806
'Why is he hiding
his face with a book?'

00:41:30.830 --> 00:41:32.350
She shouldn't come,
she shouldn't come.

00:41:39.040 --> 00:41:40.367
'Who could that be?'

00:41:40.630 --> 00:41:41.630
'Let's ask him.'

00:41:42.581 --> 00:41:43.581
Excuse me?

00:41:46.017 --> 00:41:47.737
Hey, chubby!

00:41:48.260 --> 00:41:49.773
If you cover your face,
will that belly hide away?

00:41:49.797 --> 00:41:50.811
'Sorry, belly!'

00:41:51.643 --> 00:41:53.563
'Just look at him!'
- What?

00:41:56.836 --> 00:41:59.476
I know exactly why
you're hiding here.

00:42:00.436 --> 00:42:01.346
You do?

00:42:01.370 --> 00:42:03.263
What do you know?
- Anyway, forget that.

00:42:04.756 --> 00:42:06.843
So, how was that massage?

00:42:07.108 --> 00:42:08.923
Mass.. What massage?

00:42:09.749 --> 00:42:11.743
It all happened as
I went to buy that cream.

00:42:12.316 --> 00:42:14.294
Cream? What's the matter?

00:42:14.423 --> 00:42:16.769
'Nothing.. Sorry.'

00:42:17.009 --> 00:42:18.676
I'm not going to tell you.
- Are you shy?

00:42:18.701 --> 00:42:19.862
Yes.
- All right, all right.

00:42:23.135 --> 00:42:24.868
Next week..

00:42:25.468 --> 00:42:26.494
Mom said they're going

00:42:26.518 --> 00:42:27.644
to arrange a marriage
proposal for me.

00:42:27.668 --> 00:42:29.788
A bride? All the best!

00:42:30.141 --> 00:42:33.528
Thank you. Apparently, the girl
is much fairer than I am.

00:42:35.441 --> 00:42:38.115
So, I thought I'd use
some cream to lighten my skin,

00:42:38.321 --> 00:42:39.888
so I ordered a tub.

00:42:40.508 --> 00:42:42.428
But I got caught
when I went there to collect it.

00:42:42.825 --> 00:42:44.798
Oh dear!

00:42:46.512 --> 00:42:47.530
Brilliant!

00:42:47.630 --> 00:42:49.026
Don't tell anyone else
about this.

00:42:49.232 --> 00:42:50.385
There's a whole gang around here

00:42:50.409 --> 00:42:51.729
trying to ruin
people's marriages!

00:42:51.924 --> 00:42:53.244
Don't worry.
I won't tell anyone.

00:42:53.858 --> 00:42:55.218
I won't tell anyone.
- By the way..

00:42:55.624 --> 00:42:57.491
What cream do you use
to get such fair skin?

00:42:57.970 --> 00:42:58.970
Fair?

00:42:59.910 --> 00:43:01.397
I was born with this complexion.

00:43:03.577 --> 00:43:05.150
All right. Chubby,

00:43:05.443 --> 00:43:06.680
don't trouble yourself
trying to become fair.

00:43:06.704 --> 00:43:08.140
You're handsome
just the way you are, okay?

00:43:08.164 --> 00:43:09.484
All right, all right.
- All right.

00:43:12.415 --> 00:43:14.061
That old hag Amreen..

00:43:14.668 --> 00:43:16.008
She is going around
telling everyone

00:43:16.161 --> 00:43:18.488
'do you know what Viswa did?
Viswa did this...'

00:43:18.761 --> 00:43:20.995
I feel like crushing her.

00:43:22.128 --> 00:43:23.595
Ma'am, my name is Hema.

00:43:23.888 --> 00:43:26.181
I've been practising
at this court for two years.

00:43:26.661 --> 00:43:28.068
This is my client, Selvi.

00:43:28.528 --> 00:43:29.201
Greetings, ma'am.

00:43:29.225 --> 00:43:31.545
The municipality is going to
demolish her house tomorrow.

00:43:31.635 --> 00:43:33.115
They haven't even issued
a proper notice.

00:43:33.139 --> 00:43:34.271
They're very innocent, ma'am.

00:43:34.295 --> 00:43:35.855
If this case
isn't taken up for hearing,

00:43:35.901 --> 00:43:37.395
they'll be left homeless.

00:43:37.768 --> 00:43:40.408
Then you should have filed an
urgent petition, shouldn't you?

00:43:40.641 --> 00:43:42.331
That's exactly where
the problem lies, ma'am.

00:43:42.355 --> 00:43:43.134
The hearing slot

00:43:43.158 --> 00:43:44.797
that was supposed to be
assigned to my case

00:43:44.821 --> 00:43:46.616
has been given to a
major law firm, ma'am.

00:43:46.716 --> 00:43:47.734
What?

00:43:47.834 --> 00:43:49.895
Which firm?
- RSK Associates, ma'am.

00:43:55.967 --> 00:43:57.474
There are 52 courtrooms here.

00:43:57.720 --> 00:43:59.102
Couldn't you find even one
available slot in any of them?

00:43:59.126 --> 00:44:00.430
Everything is fully booked,
ma'am.

00:44:00.454 --> 00:44:02.080
This isn't an isolated incident,
ma'am.

00:44:02.547 --> 00:44:04.114
Large firms like this

00:44:04.138 --> 00:44:06.445
get urgent hearing slots
through recommendations.

00:44:06.540 --> 00:44:08.907
Junior lawyers like me,
who have less experience,

00:44:09.027 --> 00:44:11.354
are left struggling,
not knowing what to do, ma'am.

00:44:18.044 --> 00:44:18.846
All right.

00:44:18.870 --> 00:44:20.397
Come with me.
- All right, ma'am.

00:44:22.857 --> 00:44:24.197
All right, sir. I'll call you.

00:44:26.417 --> 00:44:27.299
Yes, ma'am?
- Sir

00:44:27.399 --> 00:44:28.715
where is Mr Sundaramoorthy?

00:44:28.897 --> 00:44:30.884
Madam, he is on medical leave.

00:44:30.977 --> 00:44:31.977
What do you need?

00:44:32.710 --> 00:44:35.870
Sir, why wasn't Hema's
urgent petition filed?

00:44:37.597 --> 00:44:39.917
Madam, that's RSK's case.

00:44:41.839 --> 00:44:42.839
What is this, sir?

00:44:43.065 --> 00:44:44.159
How can you say that?

00:44:44.405 --> 00:44:46.701
They have submitted a written
representation, haven't they?

00:44:46.725 --> 00:44:48.592
Yes, ma'am, but we can't afford

00:44:48.825 --> 00:44:50.166
to antagonise someone

00:44:50.191 --> 00:44:51.791
as influential
as Mr Raj Sekar, can we?

00:44:52.083 --> 00:44:55.756
Sir, nearly fifty
people work at his firm.

00:44:56.910 --> 00:44:59.663
Can't even one person there
follow the proper procedure?

00:45:00.369 --> 00:45:02.929
List Hema's case immediately!

00:45:03.090 --> 00:45:05.576
Otherwise, they will demolish
her client Selvi's house!

00:45:06.050 --> 00:45:06.737
That would be inappropriate.

00:45:06.761 --> 00:45:08.219
It will cause a lot of trouble,
ma'am.

00:45:08.243 --> 00:45:09.403
Just because it's a big firm,

00:45:09.601 --> 00:45:11.686
does that mean they don't have
to follow the procedure?

00:45:11.710 --> 00:45:14.463
They must initiate the process
within two hours.

00:45:14.963 --> 00:45:16.763
Whatever issues arise,
I'll take care of them.

00:45:18.043 --> 00:45:19.043
Don't worry.

00:45:19.089 --> 00:45:21.299
From now on, everything will be
handled according to the rules.

00:45:21.323 --> 00:45:22.323
Thank you, ma'am.

00:45:41.052 --> 00:45:42.052
Okay.

00:45:42.164 --> 00:45:43.164
Listen..

00:45:48.655 --> 00:45:49.775
Hello?
- Shailu..

00:45:50.022 --> 00:45:52.622
I'm leaving town tomorrow night.
Can we meet this evening?

00:45:53.615 --> 00:45:55.548
Madhi, I have
a lot of work right now.

00:45:55.622 --> 00:45:57.949
Give me a little time..

00:45:58.915 --> 00:45:59.915
Hello?

00:46:00.275 --> 00:46:01.275
Hello, Madhi?

00:46:16.102 --> 00:46:17.102
Yes, Shailu?

00:46:22.095 --> 00:46:25.015
It's unclear where the funds
from that trust went, Dad.

00:46:26.362 --> 00:46:27.948
Look into it more thoroughly.

00:46:28.348 --> 00:46:28.861
If necessary,

00:46:28.885 --> 00:46:30.765
get the other junior associates
to help as well.

00:46:31.228 --> 00:46:32.362
It's not that simple.

00:46:33.928 --> 00:46:35.982
All our junior associates
are new to this case,

00:46:36.168 --> 00:46:38.828
and the case
is extremely complicated.

00:46:39.248 --> 00:46:40.615
There are so many documents.

00:46:40.702 --> 00:46:42.748
By the time I explain
everything to them,

00:46:42.975 --> 00:46:44.095
the hearing will be upon us.

00:46:44.568 --> 00:46:45.868
We can request an extension.

00:46:47.055 --> 00:46:50.248
So far, all you've done
is talk about the problem.

00:46:50.508 --> 00:46:51.755
To run this firm,

00:46:51.902 --> 00:46:53.209
you need to come up
with solutions,

00:46:53.233 --> 00:46:54.513
but I haven't heard
a single one.

00:46:56.211 --> 00:46:57.238
There is a solution, Dad.

00:46:57.666 --> 00:46:58.666
Let's hear it.

00:46:59.153 --> 00:47:00.859
It's a one-word solution.

00:47:02.679 --> 00:47:03.679
Yazhini.

00:47:04.286 --> 00:47:05.286
Yazhini?

00:47:07.310 --> 00:47:08.310
Are you joking?

00:47:08.916 --> 00:47:10.783
Are you saying that something
no one here can do,

00:47:10.807 --> 00:47:12.494
only Yazhini can do?

00:47:13.217 --> 00:47:14.563
I cannot allow this.

00:47:16.117 --> 00:47:17.117
Dad..

00:47:17.323 --> 00:47:18.663
trust me when I say this.

00:47:19.030 --> 00:47:20.579
I'm not speaking
as her elder sister here.

00:47:20.603 --> 00:47:22.230
I'm speaking purely
as an advocate.

00:47:23.063 --> 00:47:25.423
If we're going to crack this
case within the next ten hours,

00:47:26.457 --> 00:47:27.457
I need her.

00:47:32.785 --> 00:47:35.578
So, who's making decisions
based on emotions now?

00:47:36.063 --> 00:47:37.063
Me or you?

00:47:37.739 --> 00:47:39.599
Shailu, don't lecture me.

00:47:41.032 --> 00:47:42.259
I'm against this.

00:47:43.426 --> 00:47:45.652
Anyway, it's your case.
It's your call.

00:47:47.045 --> 00:47:48.045
Great.

00:47:48.311 --> 00:47:49.311
Thanks, Dad.

00:48:00.697 --> 00:48:01.697
Deva..

00:48:04.204 --> 00:48:05.610
I've been watching you.

00:48:05.730 --> 00:48:07.624
You've been tense
ever since you saw that man.

00:48:08.330 --> 00:48:09.330
What's the matter?

00:48:11.410 --> 00:48:13.530
Deva, are you going to tell me
what's going on or not?

00:48:14.804 --> 00:48:16.404
Not here. Come outside.

00:48:20.224 --> 00:48:21.224
Deva..

00:48:22.124 --> 00:48:23.124
What is it, Deva?

00:48:24.623 --> 00:48:25.623
His name is Raja.

00:48:26.504 --> 00:48:27.504
He's Thivi's father.

00:48:29.550 --> 00:48:30.550
Thivi's father?

00:48:32.597 --> 00:48:34.490
You told me both
her parents were dead!

00:48:34.777 --> 00:48:35.857
Yes, I lied.

00:48:39.190 --> 00:48:40.257
Does Thivi know?

00:48:41.270 --> 00:48:42.397
No.
- Why not?

00:48:44.264 --> 00:48:45.310
Raja is a gambler.

00:48:46.197 --> 00:48:47.577
He's addicted to gambling.

00:48:48.544 --> 00:48:50.017
He would gamble
away all the money

00:48:50.630 --> 00:48:52.544
my sister earned
and beat her every day.

00:48:56.457 --> 00:48:58.277
When my sister was pregnant,

00:49:01.057 --> 00:49:03.017
she became worried
about Thivi's future.

00:49:03.524 --> 00:49:05.804
She handed over all the money
she'd saved for Thivi to me.

00:49:09.744 --> 00:49:12.144
She was afraid he'd gamble
that money away too.

00:49:15.290 --> 00:49:17.584
Somehow, he found out
about it and beat my sister,

00:49:20.937 --> 00:49:22.577
without even caring
that she was pregnant!

00:49:24.930 --> 00:49:26.210
I was in college at the time.

00:49:26.437 --> 00:49:27.812
She didn't want my studies
to be affected,

00:49:27.836 --> 00:49:30.157
so she kept everything from me.

00:49:30.330 --> 00:49:31.710
One day, unable to endure it
any longer,

00:49:31.734 --> 00:49:32.795
she filed a police complaint.

00:49:32.819 --> 00:49:35.259
He was sentenced to three years
in prison for domestic abuse.

00:49:38.164 --> 00:49:40.644
Those three years were the only
time my sister was truly happy.

00:49:44.337 --> 00:49:45.457
That was all the happiness

00:49:46.811 --> 00:49:48.731
she was destined to have.
She had known nothing

00:49:49.157 --> 00:49:50.304
but hardship

00:49:51.117 --> 00:49:52.117
since childhood.

00:49:53.324 --> 00:49:54.577
After our parents passed away,

00:49:54.891 --> 00:49:57.784
she took on the entire
responsibility of raising me.

00:49:59.591 --> 00:50:01.117
If I've reached
this position today,

00:50:02.057 --> 00:50:03.191
it's all because of her.

00:50:07.944 --> 00:50:10.224
And yet, she never got
to experience happiness herself.

00:50:12.344 --> 00:50:13.344
Poor thing..

00:50:17.642 --> 00:50:20.371
Deva,
how did your sister die?

00:50:21.617 --> 00:50:23.777
One day, she suddenly collapsed
and lost consciousness.

00:50:24.104 --> 00:50:25.291
I rushed her to the hospital.

00:50:26.137 --> 00:50:28.071
That man had once hit her
with a wooden log,

00:50:28.544 --> 00:50:30.297
causing an internal blood clot.

00:50:32.831 --> 00:50:34.651
The internal bleeding
had become severe.

00:50:38.438 --> 00:50:40.632
Poor thing, she thought it was
just a normal headache.

00:50:45.326 --> 00:50:46.326
I couldn't

00:50:47.666 --> 00:50:48.666
save my sister.

00:50:52.626 --> 00:50:53.706
She left Thivi in my care

00:50:54.220 --> 00:50:55.220
and passed away.

00:50:58.146 --> 00:50:59.806
After he was released
from prison,

00:50:59.926 --> 00:51:01.446
he came back to take
his daughter away.

00:51:03.213 --> 00:51:04.500
The matter went to court.

00:51:07.573 --> 00:51:08.746
That was my very first case.

00:51:10.487 --> 00:51:11.907
Did you win the case?

00:51:12.990 --> 00:51:13.990
No.

00:51:14.651 --> 00:51:15.711
Before the case could
come up for a hearing,

00:51:15.735 --> 00:51:16.735
the police arrested him.

00:51:16.917 --> 00:51:19.757
He and his gang were
caught smuggling drugs.

00:51:20.064 --> 00:51:21.627
He was sentenced
to seven years in prison.

00:51:21.651 --> 00:51:23.251
Has he completed
his seven-year sentence?

00:51:24.011 --> 00:51:25.624
No, he has four months left.

00:51:25.764 --> 00:51:27.564
He's currently out
on parole for three months.

00:51:29.404 --> 00:51:31.204
Now tell me, does Thivi
need to know all this?

00:51:34.701 --> 00:51:35.701
No.

00:51:37.228 --> 00:51:39.261
Some truths only bring pain.

00:51:39.968 --> 00:51:41.168
A lie is far better than that.

00:51:42.597 --> 00:51:45.710
But paying him off won't
keep him away for long.

00:51:47.737 --> 00:51:49.511
If he comes asking for money
after four months,

00:51:49.535 --> 00:51:50.735
will you keep paying him then?

00:51:51.557 --> 00:51:54.250
I'll do whatever it takes to
secure a good future for Thivi.

00:51:57.333 --> 00:51:59.680
I can't even imagine

00:51:59.947 --> 00:52:01.460
living without her.

00:52:04.680 --> 00:52:06.613
You never have to
imagine such a life.

00:52:09.349 --> 00:52:10.349
Thivi has you.

00:54:25.042 --> 00:54:26.922
What is it? Why are you
staring at me like that?

00:54:27.488 --> 00:54:28.488
Well...

00:54:30.842 --> 00:54:33.155
I've never really shared all this
with anyone before.

00:54:33.602 --> 00:54:35.762
I'm not someone who usually
opens up about my feelings.

00:54:37.302 --> 00:54:38.302
I don't know why,

00:54:38.922 --> 00:54:40.868
but opening up to you
feels like...

00:54:41.102 --> 00:54:43.422
a weight has been lifted
off my shoulders.

00:54:47.075 --> 00:54:48.075
Why is that?

00:54:49.215 --> 00:54:50.235
I don't know either.

00:54:51.155 --> 00:54:52.155
Tube light.

00:54:52.535 --> 00:54:53.535
What?

00:54:54.169 --> 00:54:55.169
Nothing.

00:54:55.622 --> 00:54:57.102
You were just teasing me,
weren't you?

00:55:05.622 --> 00:55:06.622
Deva...

00:55:07.008 --> 00:55:08.008
Yes.

00:55:09.088 --> 00:55:10.795
Whenever something
is weighing on you,

00:55:12.302 --> 00:55:13.662
you can always
talk to me about it.

00:55:14.536 --> 00:55:15.536
I'm here for you.

00:55:25.775 --> 00:55:27.375
Hello?
- 'Yazhu, I need your help'

00:55:27.848 --> 00:55:28.908
'to crack this case.'

00:55:31.782 --> 00:55:34.375
I'll speak to Deva and
let you know. - 'Okay, Yazhu.'

00:55:35.168 --> 00:55:36.168
Who was that?

00:55:36.955 --> 00:55:37.955
Shailaja.

00:55:39.495 --> 00:55:42.155
She wants our help with the case.

00:55:42.702 --> 00:55:45.035
RSK wants... our help?

00:55:59.735 --> 00:56:00.735
Excuse me, sir.

00:56:12.015 --> 00:56:13.015
Thank you for coming.

00:56:15.275 --> 00:56:17.462
Our case hearing is
just two days away.

00:56:17.655 --> 00:56:19.642
So, we're a bit short on time.

00:56:20.608 --> 00:56:23.528
To resolve this case,
I need your help.

00:56:24.422 --> 00:56:25.422
Our case?

00:56:25.688 --> 00:56:27.435
Rather say, it's the case
you snatched from us.

00:56:28.855 --> 00:56:31.462
And now, to solve it,
you're asking us for help?

00:56:32.742 --> 00:56:33.795
Why should we help you?

00:56:35.648 --> 00:56:37.722
You took up this case and lost.

00:56:38.008 --> 00:56:39.655
Now you've got
another opportunity

00:56:39.742 --> 00:56:41.322
to work on that lost case.

00:56:42.802 --> 00:56:44.429
Guess you should use it wisely.

00:56:46.395 --> 00:56:47.875
I don't think
you'll need us for that.

00:56:48.321 --> 00:56:50.782
After all, you have
the most talented,

00:56:51.355 --> 00:56:52.955
hand-picked junior associates,
don't you?

00:56:53.668 --> 00:56:54.668
So, why do you need us?

00:56:58.062 --> 00:56:59.102
Was that really necessary?

00:56:59.702 --> 00:57:00.855
I told you so back then.

00:57:01.335 --> 00:57:02.455
Listen to the way she talks.

00:57:02.815 --> 00:57:03.815
Guys...

00:57:04.282 --> 00:57:05.422
This was actually my call.

00:57:05.868 --> 00:57:08.148
I don't have time for your
personal differences right now.

00:57:09.875 --> 00:57:12.215
Both of you know
a great deal about this case.

00:57:12.855 --> 00:57:15.435
If I'm to win tomorrow,
I need your help.

00:57:16.808 --> 00:57:17.822
And anyway, Deva...

00:57:18.882 --> 00:57:20.922
That bank is one of your
retainer clients, isn't it?

00:57:21.728 --> 00:57:23.401
If we lose tomorrow

00:57:23.528 --> 00:57:25.248
and an inquiry is
launched against the bank,

00:57:25.695 --> 00:57:27.535
how will you continue
doing business with them?

00:57:29.822 --> 00:57:30.822
That's true.

00:57:31.315 --> 00:57:33.462
But we can't do this for free.

00:57:34.055 --> 00:57:35.455
We have a firm to run too,
don't we?

00:57:37.275 --> 00:57:38.628
Why beat around the bush?

00:57:40.128 --> 00:57:41.515
Just name your price.

00:57:42.542 --> 00:57:43.542
Five lakhs.

00:57:44.675 --> 00:57:45.675
Two lakhs.

00:57:46.015 --> 00:57:47.015
Three and a half lakhs.

00:57:47.268 --> 00:57:48.668
Three lakhs, final offer.

00:57:53.715 --> 00:57:54.715
Upfront payment.

00:57:56.048 --> 00:57:58.222
Get their account details.
- Yeah.

00:58:08.908 --> 00:58:11.568
Good. Yazhini will give you
all the help you need.

00:58:14.922 --> 00:58:17.042
Be here tomorrow morning,
8:00 sharp.

00:58:18.915 --> 00:58:19.915
8:00 am?

00:58:20.609 --> 00:58:21.609
Sure.

00:58:21.856 --> 00:58:23.056
Make sure you don't oversleep.

00:58:23.749 --> 00:58:25.776
You wouldn't wake up
even if ten alarms went off,

00:58:26.056 --> 00:58:27.056
and you're lecturing me?

00:58:28.588 --> 00:58:29.558
We'll see,

00:58:29.582 --> 00:58:31.102
who gets there first.
- We'll see.

00:58:36.742 --> 00:58:38.502
'It's getting late.
- What's taking so long?'

00:58:38.976 --> 00:58:41.369
Amreen, is the client coming
or not?

00:58:41.816 --> 00:58:42.816
Of course she will.

00:58:44.142 --> 00:58:45.142
She has to.

00:58:45.282 --> 00:58:47.449
I'm ahead in this competition
between Yazhini and me.

00:58:47.982 --> 00:58:49.062
I have to win at any cost.

00:58:49.709 --> 00:58:51.256
Why do you keep babbling?

00:58:51.596 --> 00:58:53.169
Just be quiet for a while.
- Babbling?

00:58:54.122 --> 00:58:55.582
By the way, who's the client?

00:58:56.282 --> 00:58:58.576
A friend of a friend.
Her name is Neha.

00:58:58.802 --> 00:59:00.489
She's a model.
- A model?

00:59:08.742 --> 00:59:10.089
Amreen, is that her?

00:59:12.159 --> 00:59:14.339
'Oh my God! What a beauty!'

00:59:14.789 --> 00:59:15.789
Hi!

00:59:16.384 --> 00:59:18.463
Hi, Neha. How are you?
- I'm fine. - Hello...

00:59:22.493 --> 00:59:24.160
Just a minute.
I'll be right back.

00:59:24.388 --> 00:59:25.508
'Where's he rushing off to?'

00:59:30.713 --> 00:59:31.563
Here, have this.

00:59:31.587 --> 00:59:33.649
'It's a two-day-old puff.
It'll be really tasty.'

00:59:33.673 --> 00:59:34.673
What are you doing?

00:59:34.853 --> 00:59:37.207
Client hospital.
Didn't you teach me that?

00:59:37.340 --> 00:59:38.993
It's 'hospitality'!
- Whatever!

00:59:39.060 --> 00:59:40.633
Is that important right now?
- Sorry.

00:59:41.207 --> 00:59:42.953
'Please, have some.'
- Tell me, Neha.

00:59:43.127 --> 00:59:44.003
What's the problem?

00:59:44.027 --> 00:59:46.500
Last week, I went to a salon
to get a haircut.

00:59:47.047 --> 00:59:48.047
Okay.

00:59:48.973 --> 00:59:50.173
How much did the haircut cost?

00:59:51.366 --> 00:59:52.366
What?

00:59:52.400 --> 00:59:54.000
I asked how much it cost.

00:59:54.193 --> 00:59:55.723
That'll be useful for the case,
won't it?

00:59:55.747 --> 00:59:56.747
Twelve thousand rupees.

00:59:57.620 --> 00:59:59.260
Twelve thousand?
- Yes. - Twelve thousand?

00:59:59.420 --> 01:00:01.340
But instead of giving me
the haircut I asked for,

01:00:01.560 --> 01:00:03.293
they cut off
an extra four inches.

01:00:03.993 --> 01:00:05.320
Four inches?
- Yes.

01:00:05.607 --> 01:00:07.467
Oh my God! That's terrible!
- Yes.

01:00:08.247 --> 01:00:09.740
'Oh my God' over just four inches?

01:00:10.380 --> 01:00:11.380
'Oh my God!'

01:00:11.987 --> 01:00:13.867
Do you know that those
extra four inches cost me

01:00:13.891 --> 01:00:15.531
twenty-five lakhs in losses?

01:00:16.053 --> 01:00:18.082
Twenty-five lakhs? How?

01:00:18.107 --> 01:00:21.044
I had signed
four advertising contracts.

01:00:21.240 --> 01:00:22.433
They cancelled the contracts,

01:00:22.457 --> 01:00:24.296
saying my new look
didn't fit their requirements.

01:00:24.320 --> 01:00:26.507
The salon is entirely
to blame for this!

01:00:26.913 --> 01:00:28.333
I won't let them
get away with this.

01:00:28.480 --> 01:00:30.426
They must be held accountable!

01:00:32.493 --> 01:00:34.393
Don't worry.
We'll take care of it.

01:00:35.667 --> 01:00:36.667
Thank you.

01:00:36.940 --> 01:00:39.533
No problem. - You haven't eaten
the puff at all. Hello, hello...

01:00:40.134 --> 01:00:42.414
Could you give us your number
so we can discuss the case...

01:00:42.600 --> 01:00:43.893
Hello...
- Shut up!

01:00:44.645 --> 01:00:45.645
What's that?

01:00:46.853 --> 01:00:49.013
If losing four inches of hair
is grounds for a lawsuit,

01:00:49.107 --> 01:00:51.367
then I should sue every barber
in our hometown!

01:00:51.620 --> 01:00:52.900
Why?
- What do you mean by 'why'?

01:00:52.960 --> 01:00:55.300
If you ask for a haircut
like actor Suriya's,

01:00:55.427 --> 01:00:56.307
he'll give you a haircut

01:00:56.331 --> 01:00:57.896
that looks like
rats had been at your hair!

01:00:57.920 --> 01:01:00.240
You can't even step outside
without stray dogs chasing you!

01:01:00.373 --> 01:01:01.533
All right, come on. Let's go.

01:01:01.713 --> 01:01:02.926
Where to?
- We need to inform Muthu

01:01:03.019 --> 01:01:04.059
and file the case.

01:01:04.133 --> 01:01:06.633
Let's go.
Two puffs gone to waste!

01:01:16.511 --> 01:01:17.524
'Where is she?'

01:01:25.432 --> 01:01:26.732
Madam is late.

01:01:28.719 --> 01:01:29.959
Someone said,
'Yazhu...'

01:01:30.272 --> 01:01:31.065
'you won't oversleep, will you?'

01:01:31.089 --> 01:01:32.449
'You'll get here early,
won't you?'

01:01:33.285 --> 01:01:34.678
Oh, get lost!

01:01:35.191 --> 01:01:37.538
The alarm didn't ring.
It's not my fault!

01:01:38.518 --> 01:01:40.478
Anyway, why did you ask me
to come to this office?

01:01:40.665 --> 01:01:41.885
Dad will come there, right?

01:01:42.451 --> 01:01:43.646
I didn't want to create
unnecessary tension.

01:01:43.670 --> 01:01:45.458
I can't deal with that.
That's why.

01:01:48.989 --> 01:01:49.989
Fair enough.

01:01:51.303 --> 01:01:54.383
Okay, let's get to the case.

01:01:57.068 --> 01:01:59.788
Money was transferred from
the bank to Willstone Trust

01:01:59.813 --> 01:02:01.950
through the accounts of
fifty different companies.

01:02:02.968 --> 01:02:04.681
Where did the money go
after that?

01:02:05.088 --> 01:02:06.408
That's what
we need to figure out.

01:02:06.869 --> 01:02:09.049
Hey, we've already
figured that out!

01:02:09.317 --> 01:02:10.317
How?

01:02:10.893 --> 01:02:11.893
Wait.

01:02:19.225 --> 01:02:20.225
This is Anjali Varma,

01:02:20.365 --> 01:02:22.618
the chairperson and a board
member of Willstone Trust.

01:02:22.778 --> 01:02:23.778
Yes.

01:02:23.958 --> 01:02:25.612
Her husband is Vinay Varma.

01:02:26.238 --> 01:02:28.365
He owns Karan Real Estate.

01:02:29.725 --> 01:02:31.865
Three months ago, they announced

01:02:31.889 --> 01:02:34.029
a massive township
project in Chennai.

01:02:34.485 --> 01:02:36.675
The project is estimated to
be worth three hundred crores.

01:02:36.765 --> 01:02:38.029
It's all starting to
make sense now, isn't it?

01:02:38.105 --> 01:02:39.105
Yazhu...

01:02:39.838 --> 01:02:41.378
I don't believe in coincidences.

01:02:42.525 --> 01:02:43.685
This is a major lead.
Hold on.

01:02:44.718 --> 01:02:45.968
Let's verify this.

01:02:49.293 --> 01:02:50.293
'Yes, ma'am?'

01:02:50.590 --> 01:02:54.230
Contact all our sources at RERA
and the registration offices.

01:02:54.302 --> 01:02:55.302
'Okay, ma'am.'

01:02:55.339 --> 01:02:56.609
Find out whether

01:02:56.629 --> 01:02:59.070
Willstone Trust sold any
land to Karan Real Estate.

01:02:59.403 --> 01:03:01.323
You have thirty minutes. Now.
- 'Sure, ma'am.'

01:03:04.698 --> 01:03:06.278
You can get all that
done in thirty minutes?

01:03:06.302 --> 01:03:07.302
Didn't you know that?

01:03:08.004 --> 01:03:10.258
With RSK's network
and connections,

01:03:10.311 --> 01:03:12.491
we can get any information
in the blink of an eye.

01:03:13.478 --> 01:03:14.478
Impressive, indeed.

01:03:14.991 --> 01:03:16.257
If I'd had these resources,

01:03:16.281 --> 01:03:17.801
I would have cracked
the case long ago.

01:03:18.978 --> 01:03:20.178
I wouldn't have lost the case.

01:03:21.058 --> 01:03:23.658
Okay. I'm putting all my
resources at your disposal.

01:03:24.578 --> 01:03:25.578
Now, crack the case.

01:03:26.298 --> 01:03:27.378
All right, let's get to it.

01:03:44.666 --> 01:03:46.426
What is it?
- Well...

01:03:46.736 --> 01:03:47.789
Do you remember something?

01:03:48.696 --> 01:03:49.503
Back in school,

01:03:49.527 --> 01:03:51.596
we used to sit together and do
our homework just like this.

01:03:53.389 --> 01:03:54.403
That's right!

01:03:55.209 --> 01:03:56.723
I used to dump
all my record work on you

01:03:56.747 --> 01:03:57.839
while I enjoyed myself.

01:03:57.863 --> 01:03:58.863
Look at me now!

01:03:58.969 --> 01:04:00.883
Why? What's wrong now?
- Hello!

01:04:01.283 --> 01:04:02.883
Have you forgotten
how you and dad

01:04:02.907 --> 01:04:04.567
used to take turns torturing me?

01:04:05.962 --> 01:04:06.892
That's right.

01:04:06.916 --> 01:04:08.436
You were our punching bag,
weren't you?

01:04:08.736 --> 01:04:09.736
What?

01:04:10.563 --> 01:04:11.883
You talk too much!

01:04:11.969 --> 01:04:12.969
Focus on your work.

01:04:13.529 --> 01:04:14.889
All right, back to work.

01:04:24.546 --> 01:04:26.166
Good morning, Madam President...

01:04:32.573 --> 01:04:33.573
Ma'am, here you go.

01:04:34.300 --> 01:04:36.260
I've got all the details
you asked for right here.

01:04:37.293 --> 01:04:38.733
You may leave,
I'll look into these.

01:04:38.913 --> 01:04:40.346
Okay, ma'am.

01:04:43.540 --> 01:04:46.020
Why do you have to embarrass me
in front of everyone?

01:04:46.140 --> 01:04:48.509
What did I do?
I didn't realise they were there.

01:04:48.700 --> 01:04:50.569
I'm supposed to address
the President as 'President',

01:04:50.593 --> 01:04:52.460
aren't I?
Anyway, forget about that.

01:04:52.680 --> 01:04:54.673
I hear you stopped
the urgent petition that

01:04:54.697 --> 01:04:57.104
RSK Associates tried to push
through using their influence.

01:04:57.786 --> 01:04:59.826
Everyone is saying
'Ms Veni made a boss move'.

01:05:00.813 --> 01:05:02.626
I only did what was right.

01:05:04.066 --> 01:05:05.773
Still, you know Raj Sekar
very well.

01:05:06.273 --> 01:05:08.606
If you hurt his ego,
he'll definitely retaliate.

01:05:09.300 --> 01:05:10.700
You should be
prepared for anything.

01:05:11.120 --> 01:05:12.460
Whatever trouble comes my way,

01:05:12.706 --> 01:05:13.933
I'm ready to face it.

01:05:17.553 --> 01:05:18.553
Have a good day.

01:05:35.112 --> 01:05:36.532
Let's go, Kishore.

01:05:37.699 --> 01:05:38.792
Sir...
- Yeah?

01:05:40.258 --> 01:05:41.938
Sir, that is...
- What is it?

01:05:42.018 --> 01:05:43.378
Stop stammering and speak!

01:05:43.817 --> 01:05:47.170
Sir, about the urgent hearing
petition we filed earlier...

01:05:47.837 --> 01:05:50.103
Veni intervened
and put it on hold, sir.

01:05:50.286 --> 01:05:52.246
Why? - The advocates
from the other chambers

01:05:52.270 --> 01:05:53.750
complained to Veni.

01:05:53.899 --> 01:05:54.942
They said that
big firms like ours

01:05:54.966 --> 01:05:57.672
get their cases
listed immediately,

01:05:57.726 --> 01:05:59.579
while their cases don't
get listed at all, sir.

01:06:03.592 --> 01:06:05.872
So, she's throwing her weight
around as the president, is she?

01:06:07.839 --> 01:06:08.839
Drive me to the court.

01:06:10.979 --> 01:06:11.979
Okay, sir.

01:06:18.439 --> 01:06:19.699
Excuse me, ma'am.
- Yes?

01:06:20.622 --> 01:06:23.096
Ma'am, here's the Willstone
Trust file you requested,

01:06:23.616 --> 01:06:25.482
along with
the Karan Real Estate file.

01:06:26.089 --> 01:06:27.089
Okay.

01:06:27.262 --> 01:06:29.342
You may leave. Thank you.
- Thank you, ma'am. - Here.

01:06:37.716 --> 01:06:40.122
The land registration date
on this...

01:06:40.556 --> 01:06:41.989
looks wrong.

01:06:47.226 --> 01:06:48.226
Shailu...

01:06:50.570 --> 01:06:51.570
Shailu,

01:06:51.970 --> 01:06:53.350
we found what we were
looking for!

01:06:54.590 --> 01:06:55.590
What did you find?

01:06:56.397 --> 01:06:58.930
Twelve months ago,
from Willstone Trust,

01:06:59.083 --> 01:07:00.850
they bought seven acres
of land on OMR

01:07:01.410 --> 01:07:02.797
for Rs 300 crore.

01:07:03.517 --> 01:07:04.697
That very same land

01:07:05.057 --> 01:07:06.790
was sold to the owner
of Karan Real Estate.

01:07:07.383 --> 01:07:09.097
But no money changed hands!

01:07:10.950 --> 01:07:12.977
So, the sale existed
only on paper,

01:07:13.177 --> 01:07:14.697
not in reality!
- Correct.

01:07:17.630 --> 01:07:19.717
So, to put it simply,

01:07:20.523 --> 01:07:23.083
the money went from
the bank to shell companies.

01:07:23.510 --> 01:07:25.337
From there, it went
to Willstone Trust.

01:07:26.003 --> 01:07:27.517
They bought the land,

01:07:27.630 --> 01:07:29.883
and sold it to the owner
of Karan Real Estate.

01:07:30.710 --> 01:07:32.437
Yet the owner of
Karan Real Estate

01:07:32.523 --> 01:07:34.250
never paid Willstone Trust!

01:07:35.497 --> 01:07:37.716
In short, the husband
and wife teamed up

01:07:37.753 --> 01:07:39.566
and completely
swindled the bank!

01:07:40.251 --> 01:07:41.251
Correct.

01:07:42.947 --> 01:07:43.947
Yazhu...

01:07:44.101 --> 01:07:46.154
you cracked the entire case
in just five minutes!

01:07:46.788 --> 01:07:47.788
Superb!

01:07:48.235 --> 01:07:49.235
Thanks.

01:07:49.276 --> 01:07:51.169
We definitely have to
celebrate this!

01:07:51.996 --> 01:07:54.316
There's a place nearby that
serves great beer. Shall we go?

01:08:01.736 --> 01:08:02.736
Shailu...

01:08:03.852 --> 01:08:06.332
Not today. Let's celebrate
after we win the case.

01:08:06.725 --> 01:08:07.725
Who is it?

01:08:08.165 --> 01:08:09.292
Is that Deva?

01:08:12.298 --> 01:08:13.458
Are you getting back to work?

01:08:14.025 --> 01:08:15.345
Get lost! Bye.
- Bye.

01:08:28.825 --> 01:08:30.158
Good morning, Madam President.

01:08:30.512 --> 01:08:31.512
May I sit?

01:08:40.435 --> 01:08:42.755
It's been barely ten days
since you took office, hasn't it?

01:08:43.282 --> 01:08:45.688
You wouldn't have come
all this way just to tell me that.

01:08:46.062 --> 01:08:47.102
Tell me, what do you want?

01:08:49.635 --> 01:08:51.882
You know very well why I'm here.

01:08:52.775 --> 01:08:54.668
I don't know, sir. Tell me.

01:08:57.145 --> 01:08:58.145
How does that happen?

01:08:58.799 --> 01:09:00.759
Does power surge the moment
one becomes the president?

01:09:02.719 --> 01:09:04.645
I heard that you intervened

01:09:05.419 --> 01:09:07.299
and stopped my urgent hearing
from being listed.

01:09:08.759 --> 01:09:11.285
I didn't stop
anyone's hearing, sir.

01:09:12.139 --> 01:09:15.025
I only requested that
due process be followed.

01:09:16.192 --> 01:09:18.319
I received information
that certain people

01:09:18.452 --> 01:09:20.652
were misusing their influence.

01:09:22.165 --> 01:09:23.685
That needs to be addressed,
doesn't it?

01:09:25.960 --> 01:09:28.766
It was with that faith
the juniors voted for me.

01:09:29.966 --> 01:09:32.353
So, you won't allow
my case to be listed now.

01:09:32.973 --> 01:09:33.973
Is that it?

01:09:35.613 --> 01:09:38.353
Follow the same process
as everyone else.

01:09:39.273 --> 01:09:40.733
Everything will
proceed properly.

01:09:43.593 --> 01:09:45.586
My case will be listed
in ten minutes.

01:09:46.860 --> 01:09:48.240
Stop it if you can.

01:09:50.246 --> 01:09:51.246
Kishore...
- Sir!

01:09:59.106 --> 01:10:00.106
Okay, sir.

01:10:13.764 --> 01:10:16.464
Answer it. It must be
an important call.

01:10:20.222 --> 01:10:23.495
Yes, sir. - 'Did you hold up
Raj Sekar's case, ma'am?'

01:10:23.568 --> 01:10:24.741
'His petition is valid.'

01:10:25.028 --> 01:10:26.821
'Have the case
listed immediately.'

01:10:27.001 --> 01:10:28.177
'This is the registry's
responsibility.'

01:10:28.201 --> 01:10:30.868
'It has nothing to do with you.'
- But, sir... - 'Veni!'

01:10:31.281 --> 01:10:33.195
'It's an order!
Just do as you're told.'

01:10:43.208 --> 01:10:44.208
See you.

01:10:51.929 --> 01:10:52.929
Veni...

01:10:54.354 --> 01:10:55.554
Position is not power.

01:10:56.827 --> 01:10:57.881
Power is power.

01:10:58.854 --> 01:10:59.854
Understood?

01:11:20.663 --> 01:11:23.169
Deva, what are your plans
for the half-yearly holidays?

01:11:23.343 --> 01:11:25.496
Oh, that's right!
What shall we do?

01:11:27.936 --> 01:11:29.656
Why don't you come
to court with me instead?

01:11:29.849 --> 01:11:31.169
You don't have to
stay home alone.

01:11:32.389 --> 01:11:33.516
To court?

01:11:35.896 --> 01:11:38.023
Instead of taking me
somewhere on my day off,

01:11:38.076 --> 01:11:39.696
you want to take me to court?

01:11:39.756 --> 01:11:41.756
Are you crazy, Deva?
- Crazy?

01:11:42.549 --> 01:11:43.549
Why you...

01:11:44.029 --> 01:11:45.662
I have a lot of work at court.

01:11:45.943 --> 01:11:47.483
I really can't take time off.

01:11:47.663 --> 01:11:48.785
I'll tell you just one thing.

01:11:48.809 --> 01:11:51.549
Whoever marries you
is in for a miserable life!

01:11:55.489 --> 01:11:56.829
So, why are you laughing?

01:12:00.209 --> 01:12:03.070
Who in this town is a more
eligible bachelor than me?

01:12:05.220 --> 01:12:06.840
Why? Why do you say that?

01:12:07.626 --> 01:12:09.192
Hey, what am I lacking?

01:12:10.105 --> 01:12:11.238
I cook well.

01:12:11.798 --> 01:12:13.198
I take good care
of kids like this,

01:12:13.538 --> 01:12:15.278
and I earn a handsome salary.

01:12:15.845 --> 01:12:18.338
What more could anyone want?
Look...

01:12:20.178 --> 01:12:22.385
The woman who marries me
will be truly lucky!

01:12:22.485 --> 01:12:24.578
Absolutely.
- All that's fine,

01:12:25.396 --> 01:12:28.076
but don't go around
claiming that you cook well!

01:12:29.122 --> 01:12:30.982
You've barely learned
to make three dishes

01:12:31.055 --> 01:12:32.711
yet you brag like
a Master Chef contestant!

01:12:32.735 --> 01:12:35.008
Exactly! Well said, Yazhini!

01:12:35.102 --> 01:12:36.601
Instead of him
taking care of me,

01:12:36.625 --> 01:12:37.865
I'm the one taking care of him!

01:12:39.668 --> 01:12:40.668
Oh-ho!

01:12:40.955 --> 01:12:42.995
So, you two have teamed up
against me now!

01:12:43.668 --> 01:12:44.675
Fine, carry on.

01:12:45.222 --> 01:12:47.622
Anyway, Deva,
I want some ice cream.

01:12:48.055 --> 01:12:49.242
As if you'd ever miss that!

01:12:51.520 --> 01:12:53.020
All right.
Would you like anything?

01:12:53.568 --> 01:12:54.695
No, I'm good.

01:12:59.183 --> 01:13:00.263
Do you want to try this?

01:13:00.972 --> 01:13:02.632
Okay, I'll try it.

01:13:24.388 --> 01:13:25.395
Hi!

01:16:39.185 --> 01:16:40.951
Hey, why are you here?

01:16:44.550 --> 01:16:45.830
What about the money
I asked for?

01:16:46.170 --> 01:16:47.917
Didn't I tell you
I'd give it to you in two days?

01:16:47.941 --> 01:16:48.941
Now, get out of here.

01:16:59.314 --> 01:17:00.434
Bye.

01:17:08.915 --> 01:17:09.915
Go.

01:17:22.944 --> 01:17:23.873
Deva...

01:17:23.897 --> 01:17:25.324
Who is that man, Deva?

01:17:25.390 --> 01:17:26.777
Do you know him?

01:17:27.104 --> 01:17:29.904
Yes, he's an old client of mine.
That is how I know him.

01:17:32.877 --> 01:17:33.877
Yazhini...

01:17:34.017 --> 01:17:35.244
Take Thivi with you.

01:17:35.457 --> 01:17:38.104
I'll come and pick her up
in two hours, okay?

01:17:42.307 --> 01:17:43.307
Come on, Thivi. Let's go.

01:17:45.911 --> 01:17:46.911
Take care. Go on.

01:18:06.507 --> 01:18:07.496
'Ma'am.'

01:18:07.520 --> 01:18:10.473
'What am I supposed to
tell my client, Selvi, now?'

01:18:10.810 --> 01:18:12.290
'They're going to
demolish her house.'

01:18:15.475 --> 01:18:17.361
'Nothing ever changes here,
does it, ma'am?'

01:18:19.497 --> 01:18:20.497
Veni...

01:18:22.099 --> 01:18:23.979
What are you brooding over?
Eat your food first.

01:18:24.695 --> 01:18:25.695
No, Sathyan.

01:18:26.447 --> 01:18:28.954
The question
that advocate asked me today...

01:18:29.909 --> 01:18:31.456
keeps going around in my head.

01:18:33.851 --> 01:18:35.224
I can't even bring myself
to eat.

01:18:36.056 --> 01:18:38.016
They're advocates,
they're bound to question things.

01:18:38.103 --> 01:18:39.816
Sathyan...
- What's the matter now?

01:18:40.036 --> 01:18:41.701
You're worried about what
everyone will think of you,

01:18:41.725 --> 01:18:42.505
aren't you?

01:18:42.529 --> 01:18:44.496
No, no. More than that...

01:18:46.423 --> 01:18:49.356
I'm worried about
Selvi's plight.

01:18:50.383 --> 01:18:52.589
What will they do once
their house is demolished?

01:18:53.503 --> 01:18:55.416
Even if they get
justice afterwards,

01:18:55.809 --> 01:18:57.316
what good will it do them?

01:18:59.856 --> 01:19:00.772
Listen, Veni...

01:19:00.796 --> 01:19:03.249
The belief that only someone
in a position of power

01:19:03.274 --> 01:19:04.641
can get things done is changing.

01:19:05.016 --> 01:19:06.016
That's precisely why

01:19:06.116 --> 01:19:08.928
ordinary people are fighting
for everything they need.

01:19:11.096 --> 01:19:12.369
There was a time
when Raj Sekar and I struggled

01:19:12.393 --> 01:19:13.993
for even two square meals a day.

01:19:15.843 --> 01:19:17.983
We don't have to dwell
on the past all the time,

01:19:18.309 --> 01:19:20.499
but we should at least remember
some of it, shouldn't we?

01:19:20.523 --> 01:19:21.523
But Raj Sekar...

01:19:22.076 --> 01:19:24.103
He has forgotten everything
and thinks he's God.

01:19:25.283 --> 01:19:27.509
Society gives a poor man
the opportunity to become rich.

01:19:28.509 --> 01:19:30.469
However, once that same
poor man becomes wealthy...

01:19:31.049 --> 01:19:32.969
he stops thinking like
someone who was once poor.

01:19:33.883 --> 01:19:35.869
What Raj Sekar did to Selvi today
is exactly that.

01:19:36.289 --> 01:19:37.289
Sathyan...

01:19:37.456 --> 01:19:39.136
Those who trusted me
and voted for me

01:19:39.716 --> 01:19:41.476
must have completely
lost faith in me.

01:19:42.976 --> 01:19:45.163
We can't please everyone, Veni.

01:19:45.609 --> 01:19:47.649
How many people can you
keep explaining yourself to?

01:19:48.423 --> 01:19:49.423
That's why...

01:19:49.789 --> 01:19:51.236
I'm asking you what I should do.

01:19:54.309 --> 01:19:55.749
Shall I tell you a little story?

01:19:56.103 --> 01:19:57.649
Twenty years ago,
a woman advocate,

01:19:57.716 --> 01:19:59.756
returned to court after
her maternity leave.

01:19:59.983 --> 01:20:01.316
When she came back and checked,

01:20:01.663 --> 01:20:02.723
she found that her name
had been removed

01:20:02.747 --> 01:20:04.027
from the chamber allotment list.

01:20:04.849 --> 01:20:07.049
At that point, another junior
advocate who noticed this,

01:20:08.089 --> 01:20:09.609
decided to act
not just on her behalf...

01:20:09.889 --> 01:20:11.656
but also on behalf of
everyone in the same situation...

01:20:11.680 --> 01:20:12.987
She brought them all together,

01:20:13.596 --> 01:20:15.596
and filed a complaint with
the Women's Association.

01:20:16.316 --> 01:20:18.436
She even managed to get them
their chamber allotments.

01:20:18.469 --> 01:20:19.469
Her name...

01:20:19.829 --> 01:20:20.829
was Veni Chandrakanth.

01:20:23.843 --> 01:20:24.903
Back then, you didn't see it

01:20:24.927 --> 01:20:26.887
as merely a grievance
affecting just one advocate.

01:20:27.503 --> 01:20:29.316
You saw it as a flaw
in the entire system.

01:20:29.569 --> 01:20:30.809
You must do the same thing now.

01:20:33.003 --> 01:20:35.091
How do you remember everything

01:20:35.116 --> 01:20:36.756
that happened twenty
years ago so clearly?

01:20:36.943 --> 01:20:39.436
The only thing worth
holding on to is old memories.

01:20:39.983 --> 01:20:41.503
Without them,
one would simply go mad.

01:20:42.523 --> 01:20:44.763
Looking back on them now
and then brings me a little joy.

01:20:45.029 --> 01:20:46.029
Eat your meal first.

01:21:03.507 --> 01:21:05.947
Hey, did you have another fight
at home?

01:21:06.281 --> 01:21:08.607
What! Can I visit your home
only when I've had a fight?

01:21:08.674 --> 01:21:10.567
Can't I just drop by
for a visit? Move over.

01:21:20.507 --> 01:21:22.634
I just dropped by to hang out
with you for a while.

01:21:22.914 --> 01:21:23.914
Hang out?

01:21:23.961 --> 01:21:26.321
Make me some Korean noodles
that you made the other day.

01:21:27.234 --> 01:21:28.381
Yes, yes! I want some too.

01:21:29.901 --> 01:21:32.121
Looks like both of them
think I'm their personal cook.

01:21:32.661 --> 01:21:33.661
I'll deal with them.

01:21:34.275 --> 01:21:37.061
Why is she grumbling?
- Looks like something happened.

01:21:45.466 --> 01:21:46.506
What is it?
- Chop them up.

01:21:46.986 --> 01:21:48.473
Noodles aren't for free.

01:21:51.161 --> 01:21:52.161
I'm chopping them.

01:22:07.645 --> 01:22:08.645
Yazhini...

01:22:09.138 --> 01:22:11.092
Who was that man
at the hotel today?

01:22:12.706 --> 01:22:14.032
That...

01:22:14.932 --> 01:22:16.665
Is Deva in some kind of trouble?

01:22:17.218 --> 01:22:19.798
Why did he turn pale
the moment he saw that man?

01:22:20.685 --> 01:22:22.351
No, nothing like that.

01:22:23.531 --> 01:22:24.951
He's our client.

01:22:25.178 --> 01:22:27.718
He had a problem
so he came to see Deva.

01:22:28.585 --> 01:22:29.825
Don't worry about it.

01:22:31.152 --> 01:22:32.152
Okay.

01:22:46.729 --> 01:22:48.209
This is the last time
I'm helping you.

01:22:48.616 --> 01:22:49.677
Don't gamble this money away

01:22:49.701 --> 01:22:51.781
and come back for more.
Understood?

01:22:52.049 --> 01:22:54.602
I'm giving you this only because
you're going to jail next week.

01:22:54.949 --> 01:22:56.835
Hey, don't get too excited.

01:22:57.022 --> 01:22:58.022
Just four more months.

01:22:58.242 --> 01:22:59.522
After that, I'll be a free bird.

01:22:59.829 --> 01:23:01.929
I can go wherever I want
and do whatever I please.

01:23:03.375 --> 01:23:04.969
You'll get whatever you want,

01:23:05.255 --> 01:23:06.575
but there's just one condition.

01:23:08.422 --> 01:23:10.322
You must never go
anywhere near Thivi.

01:23:10.645 --> 01:23:11.645
Understood?

01:23:13.115 --> 01:23:15.142
Deva, why are you
getting so tense?

01:23:15.702 --> 01:23:17.255
Be cool. Relax.

01:23:18.861 --> 01:23:20.621
You've got the money, right?
Now leave.

01:23:48.204 --> 01:23:49.204
What happened, Thivi?

01:23:49.824 --> 01:23:52.557
Well... Deva must not have eaten
due to all that stress.

01:23:52.871 --> 01:23:54.604
So, I'm saving some food for him.

01:23:56.869 --> 01:23:57.869
Madam...

01:23:58.156 --> 01:23:59.794
Once Deva arrives, we'll prepare
something fresh for him.

01:23:59.818 --> 01:24:00.818
You eat now.

01:24:01.588 --> 01:24:02.588
Eat.

01:24:07.582 --> 01:24:08.802
This is solid, Shailu.

01:24:09.202 --> 01:24:11.115
With this, we can corner
Karunakaran completely.

01:24:11.355 --> 01:24:12.449
He won't see this coming.

01:24:12.961 --> 01:24:13.961
Good.

01:24:14.148 --> 01:24:15.148
Good job.

01:24:15.842 --> 01:24:16.842
Thanks, Dad.

01:24:17.522 --> 01:24:18.522
However...

01:24:19.328 --> 01:24:20.808
I wasn't the one
who figured this out.

01:24:21.614 --> 01:24:22.614
Yazhu.

01:24:23.411 --> 01:24:24.491
What are you trying to say?

01:24:24.618 --> 01:24:26.011
I know she's good at research.

01:24:27.169 --> 01:24:28.303
No, Dad...
- Listen, Shailu.

01:24:28.784 --> 01:24:30.470
I have thirty years
of experience.

01:24:30.736 --> 01:24:32.216
That counts for something,
doesn't it?

01:24:32.773 --> 01:24:35.253
In all my years of experience,
I've never been wrong.

01:24:35.658 --> 01:24:36.885
That's not what I meant, Dad.

01:24:37.051 --> 01:24:38.992
If you just give her one chance,

01:24:39.016 --> 01:24:40.176
you'll see...
- Listen, Shailu.

01:24:40.938 --> 01:24:43.951
Both of you argued
against Karunakaran.

01:24:44.265 --> 01:24:45.305
Same playing field.

01:24:45.425 --> 01:24:46.425
You won, and she lost.

01:24:46.818 --> 01:24:47.898
That's all.

01:24:48.004 --> 01:24:50.091
Did she have the resources
I had, Dad?

01:24:51.524 --> 01:24:53.885
I didn't have the resources
you had while growing up, either.

01:24:53.909 --> 01:24:56.264
What can we do about that?
Life isn't always fair.

01:24:57.368 --> 01:24:59.848
Dad, we can't look at everything
as black-and-white.

01:25:00.648 --> 01:25:02.215
Well, that's how I see it.

01:25:02.522 --> 01:25:03.522
Anything else?

01:25:05.819 --> 01:25:06.819
No, Dad.

01:25:07.279 --> 01:25:08.279
Then leave.

01:25:25.602 --> 01:25:26.802
Where has Deva disappeared to?

01:25:32.385 --> 01:25:33.592
Hey, Yazhini.

01:25:34.912 --> 01:25:35.912
Where's your boss?

01:25:36.755 --> 01:25:39.195
Sorry, I wanted to
ask you something.

01:25:39.902 --> 01:25:41.496
Your father took the case
away from you

01:25:41.929 --> 01:25:44.249
and handed it to your sister.
Is that true?

01:25:44.956 --> 01:25:46.822
You know, I felt so sad!

01:25:48.136 --> 01:25:50.176
Your father has
no compassion at all, does he?

01:25:51.577 --> 01:25:53.103
Your name might mean compassion,

01:25:53.701 --> 01:25:54.941
but you possess none.

01:25:55.157 --> 01:25:57.017
Tough luck.
- Nice.

01:25:57.241 --> 01:25:58.401
That's a good line, isn't it?

01:26:00.058 --> 01:26:02.018
You lost the only case you had,

01:26:02.618 --> 01:26:04.731
yet you never run
out of punchlines.

01:26:04.953 --> 01:26:05.953
Sir...

01:26:06.212 --> 01:26:09.678
You haven't won a single case
against RSK so far, have you?

01:26:10.283 --> 01:26:11.776
What will you do now?
- That!

01:26:12.203 --> 01:26:14.363
This fire. This is what
I like about you.

01:26:16.389 --> 01:26:19.103
I'll give you the answer
to your question in court.

01:26:19.703 --> 01:26:20.703
Shall I take my leave?

01:26:21.528 --> 01:26:22.528
Bye!

01:26:34.518 --> 01:26:35.518
Your Honour...

01:26:36.465 --> 01:26:38.105
As I mentioned during
last week's hearing,

01:26:39.271 --> 01:26:41.231
in an attempt to divert
attention from this case...

01:26:41.611 --> 01:26:43.411
the prosecution is doing
everything it can.

01:26:43.598 --> 01:26:46.805
In fact, they're now
questioning a charitable trust.

01:26:47.112 --> 01:26:48.112
With your permission,

01:26:48.271 --> 01:26:50.745
may I present to you
this document? On page three...

01:26:51.411 --> 01:26:53.171
there is a list of
welfare activities.

01:26:53.431 --> 01:26:54.414
With your permission...

01:26:54.438 --> 01:26:57.258
may I highlight a few for the
benefit all of us in the court?

01:26:57.691 --> 01:26:59.271
Please proceed.
- Thank you, My Lord.

01:27:01.631 --> 01:27:04.485
Free education for 2,000 people.

01:27:05.018 --> 01:27:06.978
Housing assistance
for underprivileged

01:27:08.111 --> 01:27:10.578
migrant workers. In addition
women's welfare programmes,

01:27:10.878 --> 01:27:11.931
medical camps,

01:27:12.391 --> 01:27:13.391
polio clinics,

01:27:13.651 --> 01:27:14.972
and the list goes on, My Lord.

01:27:15.498 --> 01:27:17.338
You have the complete details
in front of you.

01:27:17.638 --> 01:27:20.425
And yet, against such
a benevolent charitable trust...

01:27:20.865 --> 01:27:22.818
the prosecution is
casting doubt, My Lord.

01:27:23.225 --> 01:27:24.225
What a shame!

01:27:24.645 --> 01:27:25.645
And that too...

01:27:25.818 --> 01:27:29.151
with absolutely
no concrete evidence.

01:27:29.431 --> 01:27:31.358
Frankly, it is the trust
that should.

01:27:31.645 --> 01:27:34.697
file a defamation suit against
the prosecution, My Lord.

01:27:34.752 --> 01:27:35.859
Objection, My Lord.

01:27:37.651 --> 01:27:39.318
In fact, there is evidence,
My Lord.

01:27:39.545 --> 01:27:41.218
The picture
Karunakaran has painted

01:27:41.242 --> 01:27:42.402
so far looks very convincing.

01:27:42.745 --> 01:27:44.705
However, if this court
grants me just two minutes...

01:27:45.045 --> 01:27:46.505
Just two minutes' time...

01:27:46.785 --> 01:27:48.891
I will prove that
the entire story is fake.

01:27:49.045 --> 01:27:51.858
Sustained. Please proceed.
- Thank you, My Lord.

01:27:58.952 --> 01:27:59.819
My Lord...

01:27:59.843 --> 01:28:02.690
I would like to call upon Anjali
Varma on to the witness box please.

01:28:02.715 --> 01:28:05.043
Objection, My Lord.
- On what grounds?

01:28:05.281 --> 01:28:06.914
Why are you objecting,
Karunakaran?

01:28:06.939 --> 01:28:09.987
She's on the witness list,
isn't she? You proceed.

01:28:11.487 --> 01:28:12.487
Thank you, My Lord.

01:28:18.643 --> 01:28:19.643
State your name...

01:28:20.130 --> 01:28:23.537
Could you clearly explain
your connection to this trust?

01:28:23.697 --> 01:28:24.890
My name is Anjali Varma.

01:28:25.217 --> 01:28:26.697
I am the chairperson
of this trust.

01:28:26.903 --> 01:28:28.143
I will keep this short, Anjali.

01:28:28.877 --> 01:28:31.283
I heard your trust
has many donors...

01:28:31.570 --> 01:28:32.897
globally.
- Yes.

01:28:34.290 --> 01:28:36.963
How do you use those funds?

01:28:37.017 --> 01:28:40.024
We use them for
various welfare activities.

01:28:40.463 --> 01:28:42.897
Apart from welfare activities...

01:28:43.263 --> 01:28:44.863
do you also buy land? Land?

01:28:47.583 --> 01:28:49.490
Let me ask you again.
Do you buy land?

01:28:50.583 --> 01:28:51.903
Well...
- No...

01:28:53.097 --> 01:28:55.830
Please explain clearly
so that the court can understand.

01:28:59.523 --> 01:29:00.803
We purchase land when necessary.

01:29:02.003 --> 01:29:03.003
All right.

01:29:06.183 --> 01:29:07.643
Please check this document

01:29:07.743 --> 01:29:09.423
and confirm whether
the signature is yours.

01:29:09.537 --> 01:29:10.610
Objection, My Lord.

01:29:11.197 --> 01:29:13.683
This document has no connection
whatsoever to the present case.

01:29:14.010 --> 01:29:15.259
It is relevant, My Lord.

01:29:15.283 --> 01:29:17.323
If Mr Karunakaran could
stop panicking as usual

01:29:17.577 --> 01:29:18.977
and remain seated for a moment...

01:29:19.150 --> 01:29:20.870
I will explain it to
this honourable court.

01:29:21.043 --> 01:29:23.937
Objection overruled. Please
be seated, Mr Karunakaran.

01:29:24.403 --> 01:29:25.403
You may proceed.

01:29:25.517 --> 01:29:27.537
Thank you, My Lord.
Tell me, Ms Anjali.

01:29:28.183 --> 01:29:29.330
Answer the question.

01:29:29.843 --> 01:29:32.429
Don't look around.
Is this your signature?

01:29:33.062 --> 01:29:34.062
Yes.

01:29:34.462 --> 01:29:35.462
Thank you.

01:29:37.736 --> 01:29:38.736
My Lord,

01:29:39.056 --> 01:29:40.436
this is a copy of the sale deed

01:29:40.536 --> 01:29:42.569
for the purchase of
seven acres of land

01:29:42.594 --> 01:29:45.889
on OMR by this NGO trust,
roughly worth 300 crores.

01:29:49.956 --> 01:29:52.757
The trust sold that very same
land to Karan Real Estate...

01:29:52.876 --> 01:29:54.742
for Rs 300 crore.

01:29:54.916 --> 01:29:56.462
To put it simply...

01:29:56.549 --> 01:29:59.096
The wife bought the land
and sold it to her husband.

01:29:59.436 --> 01:30:01.316
At this point, I would
like to remind the court,

01:30:01.516 --> 01:30:04.269
that the loan amount illegally
sanctioned by the bank,

01:30:04.936 --> 01:30:06.229
was also Rs 300 crore.

01:30:06.429 --> 01:30:08.296
But, My Lord...
- Mr Karunakaran,

01:30:08.582 --> 01:30:11.216
are you going to call this
a mere coincidence? Am I right?

01:30:11.589 --> 01:30:13.016
Be seated, Karunakaran.

01:30:16.876 --> 01:30:17.876
My Lord...

01:30:18.116 --> 01:30:19.582
The proceeds from this sale

01:30:19.749 --> 01:30:21.629
were never credited to
the trust's bank account.

01:30:22.062 --> 01:30:23.262
How is that possible, My Lord?

01:30:23.922 --> 01:30:25.596
Because this is a bogus sale.

01:30:25.856 --> 01:30:27.962
To save your husband's
company from its losses,

01:30:28.016 --> 01:30:29.702
you diverted money
through the trust

01:30:29.727 --> 01:30:31.447
and defrauded the entire
system. Am I right?

01:30:31.856 --> 01:30:34.536
This is Karan Real Estates'
new township, yes or no?

01:30:34.982 --> 01:30:35.982
No, well...

01:30:36.049 --> 01:30:38.029
This township is being built on
the very land you sold.

01:30:38.053 --> 01:30:39.053
Yes or no?

01:30:39.362 --> 01:30:40.362
Yes.

01:30:45.099 --> 01:30:46.099
Thank you, Anjali.

01:30:52.022 --> 01:30:54.535
My Lord, it couldn't get
more obvious than this.

01:30:55.005 --> 01:30:58.498
A husband and wife conspired to
carry out such a massive scam.

01:30:58.922 --> 01:31:00.322
Having committed
all these offences,

01:31:00.562 --> 01:31:02.562
they have not only shifted
the blame onto the bank,

01:31:02.715 --> 01:31:04.582
but also misled the public.

01:31:04.682 --> 01:31:06.575
Based on the evidence
we have gathered,

01:31:06.835 --> 01:31:07.982
one thing is clear.

01:31:08.282 --> 01:31:10.675
Only a few people within
the bank, just a few...

01:31:10.908 --> 01:31:13.222
colluded with
Vinay Varma and Anjali Varma.

01:31:13.408 --> 01:31:14.408
However, My Lord,

01:31:14.550 --> 01:31:16.590
we cannot hold the entire
bank responsible for this.

01:31:16.842 --> 01:31:19.382
Therefore, I humbly
request this honourable court

01:31:19.675 --> 01:31:21.707
to immediately lift
the operational restrictions

01:31:21.731 --> 01:31:22.731
off the bank.

01:31:23.682 --> 01:31:24.755
At the same time,

01:31:25.182 --> 01:31:27.168
Anjali Varma, chairperson
of the NGO trust,

01:31:27.275 --> 01:31:29.435
and Vinay Varma,
CEO of Karan Real Estates,

01:31:29.648 --> 01:31:32.282
along with their accomplices,
Jafar and CA Dhanaseelan,

01:31:32.408 --> 01:31:34.888
I request that the court award
them all appropriate punishment.

01:31:35.188 --> 01:31:36.288
That's all, My Lord.

01:31:43.052 --> 01:31:45.079
Do you admit to the offence,
Mrs Anjali?

01:31:46.102 --> 01:31:47.102
Yes.

01:31:47.767 --> 01:31:48.933
Very well. You may leave.

01:31:51.384 --> 01:31:53.964
This case is
a clear case of scam.

01:31:54.544 --> 01:31:57.971
Although a few bank employees
were involved in this,

01:31:58.231 --> 01:32:00.991
the entire bank cannot be held
responsible for their actions.

01:32:01.064 --> 01:32:03.397
Based on the testimony
presented today,

01:32:03.544 --> 01:32:05.624
it has been clearly
established that

01:32:05.744 --> 01:32:08.231
this was a premeditated scam
orchestrated by

01:32:08.337 --> 01:32:10.067
Karan Real Estates
and Wellstone Trust.

01:32:10.091 --> 01:32:12.737
This court orders that
Anjali Varma and Vinay Varma

01:32:12.791 --> 01:32:15.964
be arrested immediately.

01:32:16.024 --> 01:32:18.531
The investigating
officer is directed

01:32:18.556 --> 01:32:21.324
to interrogate them
and arrest everyone

01:32:21.348 --> 01:32:24.235
involved in this scam.

01:32:24.564 --> 01:32:26.444
This court also orders that

01:32:26.571 --> 01:32:29.091
the restrictions placed
on the bank be lifted.

01:32:31.211 --> 01:32:32.697
The court is adjourned.

01:32:40.572 --> 01:32:41.672
Shailu!

01:32:45.635 --> 01:32:47.201
Superb, Shailu! You nailed it!

01:32:48.468 --> 01:32:50.255
Congrats! You did well.

01:32:50.630 --> 01:32:51.630
Thank you.

01:32:52.284 --> 01:32:54.091
Actually, I should be
thanking both of you.

01:32:54.651 --> 01:32:56.151
You were the one
who solved this case.

01:32:57.634 --> 01:32:58.954
Sir, shall we go
to the bank and...

01:33:05.326 --> 01:33:06.573
What is it, Mr Karunakaran?

01:33:07.858 --> 01:33:10.879
You've lost that
usual smile of yours?

01:33:13.077 --> 01:33:14.077
I understand.

01:33:14.489 --> 01:33:17.416
You've also been trying to
bring RSK down for so long.

01:33:18.247 --> 01:33:21.314
So, I know how desperately
you want this victory.

01:33:21.338 --> 01:33:22.338
I know that very well.

01:33:22.674 --> 01:33:24.674
But I'm sorry, Mr Karunakaran.

01:33:25.054 --> 01:33:26.228
That day will never come.

01:33:26.615 --> 01:33:28.621
Sorry to burst your bubble. Bye!

01:33:53.494 --> 01:33:56.481
At last, God has saved us
from that case. - Yes, Dad.

01:33:56.686 --> 01:33:58.980
I feel relieved at last.
- Sir... - Deva is here.

01:33:59.446 --> 01:34:01.833
Congratulations, sir.
I can finally feel at peace.

01:34:03.140 --> 01:34:04.367
We feel the same way.
- Sir!

01:34:05.821 --> 01:34:07.068
Please forgive me, sir.

01:34:07.388 --> 01:34:09.402
I acted rashly
and hit you that day.

01:34:09.735 --> 01:34:11.128
Please forgive me, sir.

01:34:11.351 --> 01:34:13.087
Madam, please forgive me too.
- That's all right.

01:34:13.111 --> 01:34:15.111
Thank you very much.
I'll leave now, sir.

01:34:19.158 --> 01:34:21.638
What happened, Deva?
Why do you look so troubled?

01:34:23.764 --> 01:34:24.764
I'm sorry, sir.

01:34:24.877 --> 01:34:27.891
We wanted to win the case
and get you released.

01:34:28.231 --> 01:34:29.831
But...
- Deva,

01:34:30.051 --> 01:34:33.351
I will never forget the help
that you both gave me.

01:34:33.551 --> 01:34:35.964
You have restored
my lost honour.

01:34:36.357 --> 01:34:38.484
Thank you so much, Deva.
We'll take our leave now.

01:34:38.697 --> 01:34:39.737
See you later, madam.

01:34:39.777 --> 01:34:41.585
See you, Deva. - See you.
- Come, dear. Let's go.

01:34:41.609 --> 01:34:42.609
Come on, Dad.

01:34:47.271 --> 01:34:48.391
What are you thinking about?

01:34:51.091 --> 01:34:52.497
The victory we should have had.

01:34:53.011 --> 01:34:55.404
Yazhini, it would
have been wonderful

01:34:55.464 --> 01:34:57.133
if we had won this case.
I don't deny it.

01:34:57.157 --> 01:34:59.284
But the very firm that
once said it didn't want you

01:34:59.584 --> 01:35:01.404
called you back
and asked for your help.

01:35:01.557 --> 01:35:03.077
Do you realise
how significant that is?

01:35:03.371 --> 01:35:04.451
That's your growth.

01:35:06.337 --> 01:35:07.417
Shall I tell you something?

01:35:08.644 --> 01:35:11.684
The one decision I made
purely on instinct

01:35:12.242 --> 01:35:13.448
was choosing you.

01:35:15.942 --> 01:35:17.902
And it's the best decision
I've ever made.

01:35:18.835 --> 01:35:20.275
You're praising me too much.

01:35:22.629 --> 01:35:23.762
To tell you the truth,

01:35:24.155 --> 01:35:25.322
my mom often used to say

01:35:25.782 --> 01:35:27.669
that whenever
hardship befalls us,

01:35:28.215 --> 01:35:30.102
God, Himself,
sends an angel our way.

01:35:31.395 --> 01:35:33.569
The angel who entered my life
that way is you.

01:36:17.129 --> 01:36:19.902
Yeah, congrats.
- Thank you.

01:36:33.285 --> 01:36:34.431
Come on, feed me too!

01:36:38.154 --> 01:36:39.981
Congrats.
- Thank you.

01:36:40.023 --> 01:36:41.243
Oh, that's cute.

01:36:42.004 --> 01:36:43.004
What would you like?

01:36:44.372 --> 01:36:45.372
The usual.

01:36:46.327 --> 01:36:47.327
Done.

01:36:49.962 --> 01:36:51.089
What's going on here?

01:36:53.067 --> 01:36:54.067
Sit.

01:37:01.438 --> 01:37:02.438
Thanks, Yazhini.

01:37:03.641 --> 01:37:04.641
What for, Dad?

01:37:05.110 --> 01:37:06.850
For supporting Shailu.

01:37:08.062 --> 01:37:10.042
Your quick and sharp mind

01:37:10.429 --> 01:37:11.629
is perfect for research.

01:37:12.213 --> 01:37:13.315
That's why I offered you

01:37:13.335 --> 01:37:15.358
the position of head
of research at our firm.

01:37:15.382 --> 01:37:16.382
But you turned it down.

01:37:16.997 --> 01:37:18.897
I hope you'll understand that
now, at least.

01:37:19.182 --> 01:37:20.182
Think about it.

01:37:20.426 --> 01:37:21.700
With your research skills,

01:37:22.066 --> 01:37:23.273
and Shailu's advocacy skills,

01:37:23.813 --> 01:37:25.906
RSK firm will be invincible.

01:37:26.246 --> 01:37:28.247
No one will be
able to surpass us.

01:37:28.699 --> 01:37:29.699
Dad...

01:37:31.371 --> 01:37:32.911
Whether you accept it or not,

01:37:33.884 --> 01:37:34.884
I'm an advocate.

01:37:35.455 --> 01:37:36.455
Just accept that.

01:37:36.724 --> 01:37:37.724
Yazhini...

01:37:38.198 --> 01:37:40.638
I've tried to explain this
to you countless times.

01:37:40.978 --> 01:37:42.818
But you simply refuse
to understand. But still,

01:37:43.785 --> 01:37:45.218
I'll try one last time.

01:37:46.698 --> 01:37:49.773
You cannot express your thoughts
as quickly as your mind works.

01:37:49.798 --> 01:37:50.798
That's a fact.

01:37:51.138 --> 01:37:53.558
But in a courtroom,
that's a major disadvantage.

01:37:53.771 --> 01:37:55.811
Any lawyer
who stands against you

01:37:55.905 --> 01:37:57.598
will use it against you.

01:37:58.071 --> 01:37:59.678
There's nothing
we can do about that.

01:38:00.458 --> 01:38:01.885
If you want to be an advocate,

01:38:01.909 --> 01:38:03.556
your clients must
have confidence in you,

01:38:03.984 --> 01:38:04.984
not doubts about you.

01:38:06.478 --> 01:38:08.325
As your father,
this isn't an issue for me.

01:38:09.211 --> 01:38:10.858
But as the CEO of a firm,

01:38:11.571 --> 01:38:12.711
it's going to be a problem.

01:38:15.017 --> 01:38:16.017
Dad...

01:38:18.004 --> 01:38:20.524
I would agree with
everything you're saying.

01:38:22.773 --> 01:38:23.773
However,

01:38:25.527 --> 01:38:27.327
if you had given me
just one chance

01:38:28.740 --> 01:38:32.863
with access to RSK's training,
resources and everything else,

01:38:32.872 --> 01:38:34.280
and I had still lost that case,

01:38:34.787 --> 01:38:36.547
then everything you're
saying would be right.

01:38:37.100 --> 01:38:38.620
But you never gave me
that chance, Dad.

01:38:38.720 --> 01:38:40.920
You even decided what I should do
all by yourself.

01:38:41.154 --> 01:38:42.914
If I had been given
the same access you have,

01:38:43.320 --> 01:38:45.440
I would have won this case
single-handedly today, Dad.

01:38:46.314 --> 01:38:47.674
But you didn't give me
that chance.

01:38:47.738 --> 01:38:48.738
What did you do instead?

01:38:49.187 --> 01:38:51.267
You made that decision
on my behalf.

01:38:51.920 --> 01:38:52.920
Yazhini...

01:38:53.560 --> 01:38:55.480
Shailu's composure in court

01:38:56.087 --> 01:38:58.247
is something you lack.
- That's true, Dad.

01:38:59.380 --> 01:39:01.934
As of today, Shailu may be
a better advocate than I am.

01:39:02.500 --> 01:39:03.680
Who is responsible for that?

01:39:05.147 --> 01:39:07.307
It's because of the trust
her father has placed in her.

01:39:07.927 --> 01:39:10.254
You've trained her for this
over many years.

01:39:10.460 --> 01:39:13.420
But when that same father looked
at me, he saw only imperfection.

01:39:14.067 --> 01:39:15.147
You did nothing to help me.

01:39:15.814 --> 01:39:18.167
Even though you knew
about my difficulty,

01:39:19.240 --> 01:39:20.240
did you ever teach me

01:39:20.407 --> 01:39:22.507
how to handle the pressure
of a courtroom, Dad?

01:39:24.753 --> 01:39:25.753
Tell me,

01:39:26.066 --> 01:39:27.066
Mr. Raj Sekar.

01:39:28.164 --> 01:39:29.164
No.

01:39:33.231 --> 01:39:35.758
Then why do you get
to decide my future?

01:39:36.216 --> 01:39:38.282
Just focus on your
own work, Dad.

01:39:39.079 --> 01:39:40.299
I genuinely want to know.

01:39:40.853 --> 01:39:44.199
Do you think the position of
research head is so disgraceful?

01:39:44.539 --> 01:39:46.899
Or is trying to protect you
such a terrible mistake?

01:39:47.195 --> 01:39:49.195
Dad, let me say this again.

01:39:49.286 --> 01:39:52.712
What you're trying to protect
is your brand, not me.

01:39:53.958 --> 01:39:54.958
Fine, Dad.

01:39:58.375 --> 01:40:00.409
If I ever feel that
I'm not a good lawyer,

01:40:00.887 --> 01:40:01.954
I will give it all up.

01:40:02.882 --> 01:40:04.842
But the only person
who gets to make that decision

